// Supplementary questions: built by tools/build_extra.py from data/extra/*.md. Do not edit by hand.
window.EXTRA = {"generated":"2026-10-11","exams":[{"code":"AB-100","questions":[{"n":1101,"id":9100101,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to recommend how to build the Tender Desk assistant to meet the business and technical requirements.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Build a custom engine agent in Foundry Agent Service and publish it to Microsoft 365 Copilot."},{"k":"B","html":"Extend Microsoft 365 Copilot with a declarative agent that adds the Rate Cards and Contracts SharePoint site as knowledge."},{"k":"C","html":"Build a custom engine agent in Copilot Studio that uses a fine-tuned model and publish it to the Microsoft Teams channel."},{"k":"D","html":"Configure the Rate Cards and Contracts SharePoint folders as knowledge sources for Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1102,"id":9100102,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You need to design the security of the Dispatch Exceptions agent to meet the security and compliance requirements. Which two actions should you include in the design? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a Foundry guardrail that adds the user prompt attack control at the user input intervention point and the document attack control at the tool response intervention point, and assign the guardrail to the agent."},{"k":"B","html":"Enable Spotlighting in the guardrail of the agent so that tool responses are tagged as lower-trust content."},{"k":"C","html":"Use managed identities for the agent's connections to its model deployment and tools, and deploy Foundry Agent Service with private networking in a virtual network."},{"k":"D","html":"Apply Microsoft Purview sensitivity labels to the carrier PDF attachments before the agent reads them."},{"k":"E","html":"Set the Violence and Hate controls to Low in the guardrail of the underlying model deployment so that the agent inherits stricter filtering."}],"answer":"AC","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1103,"id":9100103,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You need to design the in-app experiences for the claims team and the sellers to meet the business and technical requirements.<\/p><p>What should you include in the design for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1104,"id":9100104,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to recommend a model strategy for each workload to meet the business, technical, and CISO requirements.<\/p><p>Which model strategy should you recommend for each workload? To answer, drag the appropriate model strategy to the correct workload. Each model strategy may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1105,"id":9100105,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to recommend an organizational structure that meets the CEO's requirement and the governance requirement for the AI program.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a standalone AI Center of Excellence that reports to the CISO and operates from the start as an advisory group that only publishes guardrails."},{"k":"B","html":"Integrate AI expertise and practices into the existing Cloud Center of Excellence, run it as a centralized AI Center of Excellence during the initial phase, and move it to an advisory model as adoption matures."},{"k":"C","html":"Deploy the Microsoft Power Platform Center of Excellence Starter Kit and assign its dashboards to the two business units that are already building agents."},{"k":"D","html":"Distribute AI experts into each business unit's product team immediately and let the frontline teams own the AI standards."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1106,"id":9100106,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You need to recommend a test strategy for the Claims Desk agent that meets the CTO's requirement and the technical requirements for regression testing.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"On the Evaluation page of the agent, create a Quick question set and run it from the pipeline before each release."},{"k":"B","html":"On the Evaluation page of the agent, generate a Full question set from the claims-handling SOP knowledge source, save the test set, and trigger the evaluation runs from the pipeline by using the Power Platform REST API."},{"k":"C","html":"Have the QA team export the latest test chat conversation to a test set before each release and run it manually in Copilot Studio."},{"k":"D","html":"On the Monitor page of the agent, create a test set from a theme in the analytics and run it before each release."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-meridian"},{"n":1001,"id":9100001,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A retailer evaluates AI for two needs:<\/p><ul><li>Produce weekly demand forecasts for each store. The same inputs must always produce the same forecast, and accuracy is the primary measure.<\/li><li>Draft personalized promotional emails from unstructured notes written by category managers.<\/li><\/ul><p>You follow the use case identification steps of the Cloud Adoption Framework for AI.<\/p><p>You need to recommend the type of AI for the demand forecasts.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"A Microsoft Copilot Studio agent that uses generative orchestration"},{"k":"B","html":"Nongenerative (deterministic) AI, such as a machine learning model trained in Azure Machine Learning or Microsoft Fabric"},{"k":"C","html":"A declarative agent for Microsoft 365 Copilot"},{"k":"D","html":"A model router deployment in Microsoft Foundry"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1002,"id":9100002,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company follows the Cloud Adoption Framework for AI. The skills assessment places the company at AI maturity Level 1: staff understand basic AI concepts and can map out prompts, but there are no data scientists, and the only data available is enterprise data in Microsoft 365 and Dataverse. The board wants a first AI project that demonstrates a return on investment within weeks.<\/p><p>You need to recommend the first project.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"An internal, non-customer-facing proof of concept that uses a Microsoft Copilot solution, such as a Copilot Studio agent"},{"k":"B","html":"A generative AI app with retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) in Microsoft Foundry"},{"k":"C","html":"Training and deploying a custom machine learning model"},{"k":"D","html":"Training and running a small AI model on Azure Virtual Machines"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1003,"id":9100003,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company uses Dynamics 365 Sales, Dynamics 365 Finance, Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management, and Dynamics 365 Project Operations. The company wants to use prebuilt Dynamics 365 agents before building custom agents. You identify the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Autonomously research inbound leads, decide whether they are a good fit, and send outreach emails.<\/li><li>Evaluate voucher amount mismatch exceptions between subledgers and the general ledger and recommend an action such as creating a journal entry.<\/li><li>Draft follow-up emails to vendors and update purchase orders from vendor replies based on user-defined rules.<\/li><li>Review incoming time and expense entries against uploaded policy documents and mark them Ready for approval or Needs review.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to select a prebuilt agent for each requirement.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which agent should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate agent to each requirement. Each agent may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1004,"id":9100004,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<\/p><p>A company has Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses for all employees. The company needs an agent that answers employee questions about the travel policy documents stored in a SharePoint library. Users will invoke the agent themselves in Microsoft Teams and in Copilot Chat. The agent must inherit the Microsoft 365 compliance and responsible AI controls, and it must not require any additional hosting.<\/p><p>Solution: You build a declarative agent with Agent Builder and add the SharePoint library as a knowledge source.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Does the solution meet the goal?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Yes"},{"k":"B","html":"No"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"yesno","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"series":true},{"n":1005,"id":9100005,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<\/p><p>A company has Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses for all employees. The company needs an agent that answers employee questions about the travel policy documents stored in a SharePoint library. Users will invoke the agent themselves in Microsoft Teams and in Copilot Chat. The agent must inherit the Microsoft 365 compliance and responsible AI controls, and it must not require any additional hosting.<\/p><p>Solution: You build a custom engine agent with the Microsoft 365 Agents SDK, host its orchestrator and model in Azure, and publish the agent to Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Does the solution meet the goal?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Yes"},{"k":"B","html":"No"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"yesno","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"series":true},{"n":1006,"id":9100006,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A retail company has a Microsoft Copilot Studio agent that calls a model in Microsoft Foundry to answer customer questions about products. Product prices and stock levels change daily, and customers report out-of-date answers. A developer proposes fine-tuning the model on the current product catalog every month.<\/p><p>You need to recommend a solution that keeps the answers current. The solution must minimize cost.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Fine-tune the model monthly on the catalog by using supervised fine-tuning."},{"k":"B","html":"Keep the base model and ground it on the live catalog data by using retrieval."},{"k":"C","html":"Use reinforcement fine-tuning with a grader that scores price accuracy."},{"k":"D","html":"Fine-tune the model by using the Developer training type to reduce training cost."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1007,"id":9100007,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company uses a GPT-4.1 deployment in Microsoft Foundry to draft responses to warranty claims. Prompt engineering and retrieval of the warranty policy are already in place. The company asks whether it should create a custom (fine-tuned) model.<\/p><p>Which two situations justify fine-tuning the model? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Every response must follow a consistent organizational tone and a fixed JSON schema that the prompt instructions do not produce reliably."},{"k":"B","html":"Each prompt carries many few-shot examples, and the company must lower per-request token cost and latency."},{"k":"C","html":"The model must know the latest warranty policy, which changes every week."},{"k":"D","html":"The company has 12 example claims and no held-out evaluation data."},{"k":"E","html":"The company must guarantee that the model never produces harmful content."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1008,"id":9100008,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company wants a governed prompt library for Microsoft 365 Copilot. The library must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Only administrators can add, edit, or remove the approved prompts.<\/li><li>Prompts must be organized by department and appear as suggestions in Copilot Chat and as typeahead suggestions while users type.<\/li><li>Administrators must see how many users submit each prompt.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Ask each department to save prompts and share them with their team in Prompt Gallery."},{"k":"B","html":"Create organizational prompts in the Microsoft 365 admin center and pin the priority prompts."},{"k":"C","html":"Store the prompts as prompt tools in Microsoft Copilot Studio."},{"k":"D","html":"Publish the prompts in a SharePoint list and add the list as agent knowledge."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1009,"id":9100009,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A utility company equips field technicians with Windows laptops. Technicians must summarize inspection notes and classify defect descriptions while they work in remote substations that have no network connectivity. Inspection data must not leave the device, and the company wants to avoid per-token inference costs.<\/p><p>You need to recommend where the language model runs.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"A GPT model with a Global Standard deployment in Microsoft Foundry"},{"k":"B","html":"A small language model such as Phi that runs on the laptops by using Foundry Local"},{"k":"C","html":"A model router deployment in Microsoft Foundry with the routing mode set to Cost"},{"k":"D","html":"A Microsoft Copilot Studio agent published to the Microsoft Teams channel"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1010,"id":9100010,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A logistics company uses a large reasoning model in Microsoft Foundry to classify 200,000 shipment exception emails per day into 12 categories. Accuracy is high, but cost and latency are too high. The company wants to keep the accuracy for this single task.<\/p><p>You need to recommend a solution.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Generate labeled examples with the large model and use supervised fine-tuning to specialize a small model such as GPT-4.1-mini or Phi for the task."},{"k":"B","html":"Add more few-shot examples to each prompt sent to the large model."},{"k":"C","html":"Increase the reasoning effort of the large model."},{"k":"D","html":"Replace the model with an Azure AI Search index."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1011,"id":9100011,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A Microsoft Copilot Studio prompt tool sends a long grounding document followed by the instruction \"Answer only from the document. Respond with 'not found' if the answer is not present.\" Testing shows that the model increasingly ignores the instruction as the documents get longer.<\/p><p>You need to improve instruction adherence without changing the model.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Repeat the key instructions at the end of the prompt, after the grounding content."},{"k":"B","html":"Increase the temperature setting of the prompt."},{"k":"C","html":"Remove the \"not found\" instruction so that the model can answer freely."},{"k":"D","html":"Switch to a reasoning model and instruct it to show its chain of thought."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1012,"id":9100012,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A manufacturing company has an established Cloud Center of Excellence (CCoE) that governs its Azure platform. The company is starting its first AI initiatives and wants to establish an AI Center of Excellence (AI CoE) by following the Cloud Adoption Framework for AI.<\/p><p>You need to recommend where to place the AI CoE in the organization.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a standalone AI CoE that reports to the data science team and operates independently of the CCoE."},{"k":"B","html":"Integrate AI practices and expertise into the existing CCoE."},{"k":"C","html":"Distribute the AI CoE responsibilities across the product teams without a central team."},{"k":"D","html":"Outsource the AI CoE function to a Microsoft partner."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1013,"id":9100013,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company establishes an AI Center of Excellence (AI CoE). Business units submit dozens of agent ideas every month, and the executive sponsor wants evidence that the AI investments deliver value.<\/p><p>Which two responsibilities should the AI CoE define first? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a structured intake process and maintain a prioritized AI initiative backlog."},{"k":"B","html":"Define key performance indicators such as adoption rates and project cycle times and report them to leadership regularly."},{"k":"C","html":"Build and operate every production agent centrally on a permanent basis."},{"k":"D","html":"Transfer AI governance to each product team immediately."},{"k":"E","html":"Replace the Microsoft AI decision tree with a custom technology catalog."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1014,"id":9100014,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A distributor uses Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management and plans to deploy Dynamics 365 Sales. Sellers will use Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales to summarize accounts, and the summaries must reflect the customer, product, and on-hand inventory data maintained in Supply Chain Management. Changes made in either app must be reflected in the other app in near real time.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you include in the design?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"A nightly Azure Data Factory pipeline that copies the records into Dataverse"},{"k":"B","html":"Dual-write between the finance and operations apps and Dataverse"},{"k":"C","html":"A Microsoft 365 Copilot connector that indexes Supply Chain Management"},{"k":"D","html":"Export to Azure Data Lake Storage from Supply Chain Management"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1015,"id":9100015,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company uses Dynamics 365 Sales, Dynamics 365 Customer Service, and Dynamics 365 Customer Insights - Journeys. The company wants a custom AI capability on the Contact form that detects duplicate contacts and renders the result in a custom control. The capability must behave identically in all three apps. A developer proposes adding a custom topic to Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales and calling it from a Power Apps component framework (PCF) control through the Copilot APIs.<\/p><p>You need to explain why the proposal does not meet the requirement.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you tell the developer?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"PCF controls cannot render AI-generated content."},{"k":"B","html":"The Copilot APIs available in a PCF control work only against the Copilot of the current app, so the control works in Dynamics 365 Sales but not in the other two apps."},{"k":"C","html":"Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales does not support custom topics."},{"k":"D","html":"The Contact table cannot be shared across Dynamics 365 apps."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1016,"id":9100016,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A bank evaluates whether to build, buy, or extend AI components for a loan pre-approval agent. The agent must use custom orchestration with multiple models, including a domain-specific model, and must integrate three credit systems with precise decision rules. A low-code pilot in Microsoft Copilot Studio reached the limits of the required customization. The bank does not want to manage servers or train base models.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which Microsoft AI adoption model should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Ready-to-use Copilots"},{"k":"B","html":"Low-code SaaS development in Copilot Studio"},{"k":"C","html":"Managed platform (PaaS) development with Microsoft Foundry Agent Service"},{"k":"D","html":"AI on Azure infrastructure with GPU virtual machines"}],"answer":"C","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1017,"id":9100017,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company deploys model router in Microsoft Foundry for a contract analysis agent. Requests that include long contracts fail intermittently with context-exceeded errors, while shorter requests always succeed.<\/p><p>You need to resolve the errors.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Change the routing mode to Quality."},{"k":"B","html":"Configure a model subset that includes only underlying models that support the required context window."},{"k":"C","html":"Enable Auto-update on the model router deployment."},{"k":"D","html":"Change the deployment type from Global Standard to Data Zone Standard."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1018,"id":9100018,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A financial services company plans to use model router (version 2025-11-18) in Microsoft Foundry. The AI governance board approved only a specific list of OpenAI models and Anthropic Claude models. Requests must fail over to another approved model when the selected model is unavailable.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Deploy the approved Claude models from the model catalog before you enable them in model router."},{"k":"B","html":"Create a custom model router deployment with a model subset that contains at least two approved models."},{"k":"C","html":"Use the quick deploy option so that model router routes across all supported models."},{"k":"D","html":"Set the routing mode to Cost."},{"k":"E","html":"Deploy each approved OpenAI model separately before you enable model router."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1019,"id":9100019,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company uses Dynamics 365 Sales with a custom opportunity column named Deal size. Sellers refer to this value as \"expected booking\" when they chat with Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales, and Copilot does not understand the term.<\/p><p>You need to make Copilot understand the term. The solution must minimize administrative effort.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"In Copilot Studio, open the Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales agent, select the SalesSpecificQnA knowledge, and add \"expected booking\" as a synonym for the Deal size column."},{"k":"B","html":"Rename the schema name of the column to expected_booking."},{"k":"C","html":"Create a custom topic with \"expected booking\" as a trigger phrase."},{"k":"D","html":"Create a Dataverse view named Expected booking."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1020,"id":9100020,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>An ISV builds a Microsoft Power Platform custom connector so that the Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot can enrich opportunity summaries with data from the ISV's revenue intelligence API. The connector action fails when the ISV tests it in the default environment of its tenant.<\/p><p>You need to recommend how the ISV should build the connector.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create the connector in an environment where Dynamics 365 apps are enabled, and configure OAuth 2.0 authentication with Microsoft Entra ID as the provider."},{"k":"B","html":"Create the connector in the default environment and use API key authentication."},{"k":"C","html":"Submit the connector for Power Platform certification before testing it."},{"k":"D","html":"Replace the connector with a Dataverse virtual table that points to the API."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1021,"id":9100021,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company extends the Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot with a connector action published from Microsoft Copilot Studio. The connector calls the company's quoting application.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which requirement can the connector action meet?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Enrich the opportunity summaries shown to sellers with quote records from the quoting application."},{"k":"B","html":"Add a new capability to the non-chat features of the Sales agent in Outlook."},{"k":"C","html":"Replace the connection to Dynamics 365 Sales with the quoting application as the CRM."},{"k":"D","html":"Make the action available to Sales agent users in every tenant without certification."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1022,"id":9100022,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A maker builds a Microsoft Copilot Studio agent that must run autonomously whenever a row is added to a Dataverse table. The maker cannot add an event trigger to the agent.<\/p><p>Which two conditions must be true before the maker can add the event trigger? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Generative orchestration is turned on for the agent."},{"k":"B","html":"Solution-aware cloud flow sharing is turned on in the environment."},{"k":"C","html":"The agent is published to the Dynamics 365 Contact Center channel."},{"k":"D","html":"The agent uses classic orchestration with a topic that has trigger phrases."},{"k":"E","html":"Application Insights telemetry is configured for the agent."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1023,"id":9100023,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A human resources team wants an agent that answers employee questions about benefits by using the instructions the team writes and the content of the public benefits website. Employees start every interaction themselves, and the agent does not need to take actions or run on a schedule. All employees use Microsoft Copilot Chat, but the company has no Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses and does not want to incur metered consumption.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which type of agent should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"A declarative prompt-and-response agent grounded in the instructions and the public website"},{"k":"B","html":"An autonomous agent with a recurrence trigger"},{"k":"C","html":"A declarative agent grounded in a SharePoint library"},{"k":"D","html":"A custom engine agent hosted in Azure"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1024,"id":9100024,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company designs agents that call Microsoft Foundry Tools. The agents must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Extract the vendor, customer, and total fields from scanned supplier invoices by using a prebuilt model.<\/li><li>Generate post-call key performance indicators and summaries from call-center audio recordings and product videos.<\/li><li>Detect and block harmful or policy-violating text in agent responses.<\/li><li>Translate knowledge articles into more than 100 languages.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to propose a Foundry Tool for each requirement.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which tool should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate tool to each requirement. Each tool may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1025,"id":9100025,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company in Germany wants its developers to build generative pages for a model-driven app. The solution must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Developers work in TypeScript and React in their local IDE with source control.<\/li><li>The pages must be generated by the latest frontier models.<\/li><li>The Power Platform environment remains in the Germany region.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create and edit the generative pages with AI code generation tools such as GitHub Copilot CLI and deploy them with PAC CLI."},{"k":"B","html":"Use the in-browser generative page experience in the Power Apps app designer."},{"k":"C","html":"Build a canvas app and enable Copilot for the app."},{"k":"D","html":"Build the pages as a Power Pages site."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1026,"id":9100026,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company builds an autonomous Microsoft Copilot Studio agent that creates draft booking records in Dataverse. Users of a model-driven app must review the agent's tasks in the agent feed of the app. In the app designer, the Add to feed button for the agent is disabled.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Add the Power Apps MCP Server tool to the agent and set Credentials to use to maker-provided credentials."},{"k":"B","html":"Publish the agent."},{"k":"C","html":"Enable Copilot chat for the model-driven app."},{"k":"D","html":"Rebuild the agent as a canvas app component."},{"k":"E","html":"Add the agent as a connected agent of the app assistant agent."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1027,"id":9100027,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company applies the Microsoft Power Platform Well-Architected framework to a Copilot Studio agent workload. An architecture review finds that the agent has no fallback for questions it cannot answer, collects no user feedback, and uses an inconsistent conversational tone across topics.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which pillar do these findings belong to?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Reliability"},{"k":"B","html":"Performance Efficiency"},{"k":"C","html":"Experience Optimization"},{"k":"D","html":"Operational Excellence"}],"answer":"C","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1028,"id":9100028,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company has three Microsoft Copilot Studio agents that must all summarize a support case into the same fixed JSON structure. A maker created a prompt inside a topic of the first agent, but the prompt is not available when editing the second agent.<\/p><p>You need to make one prompt available to all three agents. The solution must minimize maintenance effort.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create the prompt from the Tools page in Copilot Studio and add it as a tool to each agent."},{"k":"B","html":"Export the first agent as a solution and import it into the other agents."},{"k":"C","html":"Recreate the prompt in the AI hub of Power Apps."},{"k":"D","html":"Turn on generative orchestration for the second and third agents."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1029,"id":9100029,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A bank in Sweden plans to fine-tune GPT-4.1 in Microsoft Foundry on customer support transcripts. Regulations require that the training data and the resulting model weights remain in the Sweden Central region during training. Training cost is a secondary concern.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which training type should you select?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Standard"},{"k":"B","html":"Global"},{"k":"C","html":"Developer"},{"k":"D","html":"Data zone"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1030,"id":9100030,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>The owner of the Legal SharePoint site wants an agent that answers questions only from the Contracts document library. The agent must be usable in Microsoft Teams chats, and the site owner must be able to create it without code and without publishing it to the organization catalog.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a SharePoint agent scoped to the Contracts library."},{"k":"B","html":"Build a custom engine agent with the Microsoft 365 Agents Toolkit."},{"k":"C","html":"Build a Copilot Studio agent and publish it to the organization catalog."},{"k":"D","html":"Create a Microsoft 365 Copilot connector for the library."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1031,"id":9100031,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company with Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses wants to use Microsoft-built agents instead of building its own. The company has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Compile a market research report with citations that combines public web sources with internal files, emails, and meetings.<\/li><li>Let employees look up HR policies and create IT tickets in ServiceNow from one conversational interface that the company can customize in Copilot Studio.<\/li><li>Let sellers search, synthesize, and act on sales data across the Microsoft 365 apps they use.<\/li><\/ul><p>Which agent should you propose for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1032,"id":9100032,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company uses Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management. Warehouse managers want to ask the in-app Copilot chat questions such as \"How much available stock do we have for item M0001 in each company?\" and receive answers based on live data.<\/p><p>You need to add a knowledge source to the Copilot for finance and operations apps agent in Copilot Studio.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you add?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"The finance and operations virtual entities, such as the inventory on hand table (mserp_ prefix), as Dynamics 365 knowledge"},{"k":"B","html":"A weekly Excel export of on-hand inventory uploaded as a file"},{"k":"C","html":"The company's public website"},{"k":"D","html":"The AI general knowledge option"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1033,"id":9100033,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A product owner reviews the Monitor page of a Microsoft Copilot Studio agent every week to prioritize the improvement backlog. The product owner can see the counts of thumbs-up and thumbs-down reactions but cannot open the user comments or the related session transcripts.<\/p><p>You need to grant the product owner the required access. The solution must follow the principle of least privilege.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Assign the Bot Transcript Viewer security role to the product owner."},{"k":"B","html":"Share the agent with the product owner by using only the Analytics Viewer sharing role."},{"k":"C","html":"Assign the Power Platform administrator role to the product owner."},{"k":"D","html":"Assign the System Administrator security role in Dataverse to the product owner."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1034,"id":9100034,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A Center of Excellence team wants centralized observability for all Microsoft Copilot Studio agents in a production environment. The telemetry must capture agent invocations, tool executions, outputs, and dependencies between agents in an OpenTelemetry-aligned format in Application Insights, and it must be configured once by administrators rather than by each maker.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Environment-level telemetry with Application Insights"},{"k":"B","html":"Agent-level telemetry with Application Insights configured on each agent"},{"k":"C","html":"Downloading the conversation transcripts from Dataverse"},{"k":"D","html":"The AI-generated Summary on the Monitor page of each agent"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1035,"id":9100035,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A company has two Microsoft Copilot Studio agents. Agent1 uses generative orchestration and answers from SharePoint knowledge sources. Agent2 uses classic orchestration and has 40 topics. The company wants Copilot Studio to generate a full question set for each agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which reference should you select when generating the test cases?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Knowledge sources for both agents"},{"k":"B","html":"Knowledge sources for Agent1 and Topics for Agent2"},{"k":"C","html":"Topics for both agents"},{"k":"D","html":"The latest test chat conversation for both agents"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1036,"id":9100036,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A company builds a strategy for creating test cases for a customer service agent in Microsoft Copilot Studio by using agent evaluation. The strategy has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Quickly create about 10 questions from the agent's description and instructions to start a first evaluation.<\/li><li>Evaluate the questions that real users asked about billing and payments.<\/li><li>Reuse 60 questions with expected responses that the QA team maintains in a spreadsheet.<\/li><\/ul><p>Which method should you use for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1037,"id":9100037,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A company creates an X++ class with the AIPluginOperation attribute in a Dynamics 365 Finance sandbox and exposes it as a Dataverse custom API. A Microsoft Copilot Studio agent calls the custom API through a Dataverse connector tool. The agent is in a Power Platform solution that a pipeline deploys to the production environment. After deployment, the production agent still calls the sandbox environment.<\/p><p>You need to correct the design so that the pipeline deploys the agent without manual changes.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"In the Dataverse connector tool, set the Environment input to (Current), and keep the custom API in the solution that is deployed with the agent."},{"k":"B","html":"Recreate the agent manually in the production environment after each deployment."},{"k":"C","html":"Deploy the agent by using the agent deployment wizard in Copilot Hub."},{"k":"D","html":"Export the solution as unmanaged and edit the environment ID after import."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1038,"id":9100038,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A company runs model deployments and agents in Microsoft Foundry and follows the Cloud Adoption Framework for AI to design model security. The agents call downstream Azure resources and third-party tools.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you include in the design? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Authenticate users and services with Microsoft Entra ID instead of API keys wherever the service supports it."},{"k":"B","html":"Give each agent its own governed identity through Microsoft Entra Agent ID and grant it least-privilege access to only the tools it needs."},{"k":"C","html":"Store a shared API key in the agent's system prompt so that every tool call uses it."},{"k":"D","html":"Turn off the default Microsoft.DefaultV2 guardrail on the model deployments to reduce latency."},{"k":"E","html":"Allow developers to deploy any community model from the catalog without review."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1039,"id":9100039,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<\/p><p>A company runs an agent in Microsoft Foundry Agent Service that reads supplier emails and attachments returned by a tool and drafts purchase order changes. A security test shows that hidden instructions embedded in a supplier PDF caused the agent to attempt to email an internal price list to an external address. The company must detect and block this type of attack before the agent acts, by using the guardrail assigned to the agent.<\/p><p>Solution: You create a guardrail with an indirect attack (document attack) control that scans the user input and tool response intervention points with the Annotate and block action, and you assign the guardrail to the agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Does the solution meet the goal?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Yes"},{"k":"B","html":"No"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"yesno","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"series":true},{"n":1040,"id":9100040,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<\/p><p>A company runs an agent in Microsoft Foundry Agent Service that reads supplier emails and attachments returned by a tool and drafts purchase order changes. A security test shows that hidden instructions embedded in a supplier PDF caused the agent to attempt to email an internal price list to an external address. The company must detect and block this type of attack before the agent acts, by using the guardrail assigned to the agent.<\/p><p>Solution: In the agent's guardrail, you set the Hate, Sexual, Self-harm, and Violence controls to the Low severity level at the output intervention point.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Does the solution meet the goal?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Yes"},{"k":"B","html":"No"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"yesno","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"series":true}],"cases":{"x-meridian":{"name":"Meridian Cold Chain Logistics","html":"<h5>Background<\/h5><p>Meridian Cold Chain Logistics is a European third-party logistics (3PL) provider that moves temperature-controlled pharmaceutical and food freight for 400 shipper customers. The company runs Microsoft Dynamics 365 Sales for its account managers and a model-driven Power Apps app named Cold Chain Operations, built on Microsoft Dataverse, for its dispatch and claims teams.<\/p><p>Meridian executives have approved an agentic AI program. Four workloads were selected for the first phase: a Tender Desk assistant for account managers, a Claims Desk agent for the claims team, a Dispatch Exceptions agent for the control tower, and a damage-code classifier for drivers' handheld devices. Meridian is at an early stage of its AI journey and has not built AI solutions before, but it has operated a Cloud Center of Excellence (CCoE) for Azure for three years.<\/p><h5>Current environment<\/h5><h6>Data sources<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Dataverse:<\/strong> The Cold Chain Operations app stores shipments, lanes, temperature excursions, and carrier claims. Claims records are created manually today by supervisors who read carrier emails.<\/li><li><strong>Dynamics 365 Sales:<\/strong> Opportunities, quotes, and account records. Sellers use Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales from the Sales Hub app.<\/li><li><strong>SharePoint:<\/strong> The Rate Cards and Contracts site holds tender templates, rate cards, and master service agreements. The Product Specifications and Price Lists folders on the Sales site hold Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and PDF documents.<\/li><li><strong>Reefer telemetry:<\/strong> Trailer temperature readings land in Microsoft Fabric every minute. An excursion event is raised when a reading leaves the configured range.<\/li><li><strong>Carrier correspondence:<\/strong> Subcontracted carriers send claim notifications, proofs of delivery, and damage reports as emails with PDF attachments to a shared mailbox.<\/li><li><strong>Damage notes:<\/strong> 3,000 historical free-text damage notes that drivers typed on handheld devices, each labeled by a supervisor with one of the 40 internal damage codes.<\/li><li><strong>Claims-handling SOP:<\/strong> A 3 MB PDF standard operating procedure that the claims team follows.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Apps and platforms<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Microsoft 365:<\/strong> Microsoft 365 E5 with Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses for account managers and the claims team.<\/li><li><strong>Power Platform:<\/strong> A production environment located in the Western Europe region, Copilot Studio, and Dataverse.<\/li><li><strong>Microsoft Foundry:<\/strong> A Foundry project in Sweden Central with access to Foundry Models and Foundry Agent Service.<\/li><li><strong>Developer tooling:<\/strong> The CTO's team works in Visual Studio Code with the Power Platform CLI (PAC CLI) and GitHub Copilot CLI, and deploys through an Azure DevOps pipeline.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Identity and access<\/h6><ul><li>All employees are in a single Microsoft Entra ID tenant. Sellers hold the Salesperson security role, and claims supervisors hold a custom Claims Supervisor security role.<\/li><li>Drivers use ruggedized Windows handheld devices. Cold rooms and reefer trailers have no network connectivity for long periods.<\/li><li>Carriers are external parties and have no accounts in the Meridian tenant.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Business requirements<\/h5><p>The following executives have specific responsibilities in the AI program:<\/p><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Chief Executive Officer (CEO):<\/strong> Prevent fragmented or ungoverned AI adoption across business units without creating unnecessary organizational complexity or standalone teams.<\/li><li><strong>Chief Financial Officer (CFO):<\/strong> Pay frontier-model prices only for the prompts that need them, and avoid per-token cloud charges on the handheld devices.<\/li><li><strong>Chief Information Security Officer (CISO):<\/strong> Maintain an approved list of AI models, and ensure that no request is ever served by a model that is not on the list.<\/li><li><strong>Chief Operating Officer (COO):<\/strong> Keep claims supervisors in control of every claim record that an agent proposes.<\/li><li><strong>Chief Technology Officer (CTO):<\/strong> Let developers build with code-first tooling in their local IDE, and automate regression testing of agents before each monthly release.<\/li><\/ul><p>Meridian has identified the following business requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Account managers must be able to @mention the Tender Desk assistant in Microsoft Teams chats and ask it questions in Microsoft 365 Copilot Chat while they draft tender responses in Word and Outlook.<\/li><li>The Tender Desk assistant must answer only from the Rate Cards and Contracts SharePoint site, must be used by individual account managers who start each interaction, and must be delivered in the shortest time with low-code tooling.<\/li><li>Sellers who ask Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales for product documents must get answers only from the Product Specifications and Price Lists SharePoint folders, not from every SharePoint folder that the seller can access.<\/li><li>Claims supervisors must review, correct, and accept each claim record that the Claims Desk agent proposes from a carrier email inside the Cold Chain Operations app. Claim records must never be created without that review.<\/li><li>When the Claims Desk agent cannot decide, for example when two carrier documents contradict each other, it must hand the task to a supervisor and wait for the supervisor's decision before it continues.<\/li><li>Supervisors must also be able to ask the Claims Desk agent questions about the claims-handling SOP from the app.<\/li><li>A lane profitability page in the Cold Chain Operations app must show margin by lane across six Dataverse tables.<\/li><li>Drivers must classify a free-text damage note into one of the 40 internal damage codes on the handheld device while offline, and the output must always be exactly one code from the internal taxonomy.<\/li><li>The legal team's contract clause review must always use the highest-quality model available for each prompt, regardless of cost.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Technical requirements<\/h5><p>Meridian has identified the following technical requirements:<\/p><ul><li>The Tender Desk assistant must run on the orchestrator and foundation models of Microsoft 365 Copilot and must not require any additional hosting outside Microsoft 365.<\/li><li>The Claims Desk agent must be built in Copilot Studio as an autonomous agent that is triggered when an email arrives in the shared mailbox, and it must be configured to Authenticate with Microsoft.<\/li><li>The Dispatch Exceptions agent must be built in Foundry Agent Service, must start proactively from each excursion event without a user prompt, must use custom orchestration with tools that read carrier emails and PDF attachments, and must route each request through a single model deployment.<\/li><li>For the Dispatch Exceptions agent, each request must be served by the most cost-effective model whose quality is within one to two percent of the best model for that prompt, and if a model is unavailable the request must transparently fail over to another approved model.<\/li><li>All model routing must reach only the models on the CISO's approved list, and newly released models must not be used until the CISO adds them.<\/li><li>The lane profitability page must be generated from natural language as TypeScript and React code that developers can edit in Visual Studio Code with IntelliSense and deploy with PAC CLI, and it must work although the Power Platform environment is in Western Europe.<\/li><li>The damage-code classifier must be trained from the 3,000 labeled damage notes so that it follows the internal taxonomy consistently, must run on the handheld device, and must incur no per-token cloud cost.<\/li><li>Before each monthly release, the Claims Desk agent must be regression-tested with at least 80 questions derived from the claims-handling SOP without the QA team writing the questions. The same test set must be reused release over release so that scores are comparable, and the evaluation must be triggered from the Azure DevOps pipeline.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Security and compliance requirements<\/h5><p>Meridian has identified the following security and compliance requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Hidden instructions embedded in carrier emails or PDF attachments must be detected and blocked before the Dispatch Exceptions agent acts on content returned by its tools.<\/li><li>Attempts by users to override the Dispatch Exceptions agent's instructions or change its persona must be detected and blocked at the user input.<\/li><li>Agent-to-model and agent-to-tool communication must authenticate with non-human identities that store no credentials, and must not traverse the public internet.<\/li><li>Model and dataset artifacts must be protected from theft and poisoning.<\/li><li>Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales must only show documents that the signed-in seller has permission to read in SharePoint.<\/li><li>Governance policies, security standards, compliance checklists, and adoption KPIs for the AI program must be owned by a single accountable team.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Issues and constraints<\/h5><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Region:<\/strong> The Power Platform environment is in Western Europe, where the in-browser generative page experience in the Power Apps designer is not available.<\/li><li><strong>Connectivity:<\/strong> Handheld devices lose connectivity for hours inside cold rooms and trailers.<\/li><li><strong>Claims desk workload:<\/strong> Supervisors currently spend four hours a day re-keying carrier emails into claim records, and two incorrect claims were paid last quarter because of typing errors.<\/li><li><strong>AI maturity:<\/strong> Meridian has no data scientists, and the CCoE has no AI expertise yet.<\/li><li><strong>Adoption risk:<\/strong> Two business units have started building their own agents without any governance, standards, or shared assets.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Problem statement<\/h5><p>Meridian needs an architecture for the four first-phase workloads that reuses Microsoft 365 Copilot where it fits, builds custom agents only where proactive behavior or custom models are required, keeps supervisors in control of agent output, protects the agents from prompt manipulation, controls model cost and model approval, and establishes the organizational structure that stops ungoverned AI adoption.<\/p>"}}},{"code":"AB-620","questions":[{"n":1101,"id":9620101,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to configure authentication for Adjuster Desk to meet the identity and access requirements and resolve the blocked Teams channel.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Select No authentication, add the Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot channel, and rely on Teams to identify the adjuster."},{"k":"B","html":"Select Authenticate with Microsoft, then share the agent with the Claims Adjusters security group with the User - can use the agent permission."},{"k":"C","html":"Keep Authenticate manually with the Generic OAuth 2 provider, turn on Require users to sign in, and share the agent with the Claims Adjusters security group."},{"k":"D","html":"Select Authenticate with Microsoft, then share the agent with Everyone in Tailspin Insurance."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1102,"id":9620102,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to connect the two agents to the channels described in the current environment and business requirements.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which channel should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate channel to each requirement. Each channel may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1103,"id":9620103,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to implement the compliance and security requirements for the two environments.<\/p><p>Which action should you take for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate option for each requirement.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1104,"id":9620104,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to fix the static intake card in the Report a loss topic so that it meets the technical requirements. The policy number is already stored in a variable named Topic.PolicyNumber earlier in the topic.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Add an Ask with Adaptive Card node whose card contains Input.Date and Input.Text fields and an Action.Submit button, so that Copilot Studio creates output variables from the inputs."},{"k":"B","html":"Add an Adaptive card to a Message node, then add a Question node that identifies the user's entire response."},{"k":"C","html":"In the Adaptive Card node properties, switch from JSON to Formula and set the policy number field's value to Topic.PolicyNumber."},{"k":"D","html":"In the card payload editor, type {Topic.PolicyNumber} as the value of the policy number field in the JSON literal."},{"k":"E","html":"Set the card schema version to 1.6 and use Action.Execute so that the card renders in Teams and in the website chat."}],"answer":"AC","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1105,"id":9620105,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to configure the responses of Policy Assistant and Adjuster Desk to meet the business and technical requirements.<\/p><p>Which action should you take for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate option for each requirement.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1106,"id":9620106,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You need to configure Adjuster Desk so that metric questions and monitoring meet the technical, compliance, and monitoring requirements.<\/p><p>Which action should you take for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate option for each requirement.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-tailspin"},{"n":1001,"id":9620001,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company plans to publish a customer service agent built in Copilot Studio to its public website. Customers do not have accounts in the company's Microsoft Entra tenant; they sign in to the company's portal by using a consumer identity provider that complies with the OAuth 2.0 standard.<\/p><p>The agent must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Customers must be able to ask general questions about shipping policies without signing in.<\/li><li>A topic that returns a customer's order history must call the order API on behalf of the signed-in customer by using the customer's access token.<\/li><li>The agent must keep working on the custom website channel.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to configure authentication for the agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Select Authenticate with Microsoft and turn on Require users to sign in."},{"k":"B","html":"Select Authenticate manually with the Generic OAuth 2 service provider, turn off Require users to sign in, and add an Authenticate node to the order history topic."},{"k":"C","html":"Select No authentication and pass the customer's identity to the agent as a global variable that the website sets."},{"k":"D","html":"Select Authenticate manually with the Generic OAuth 2 service provider and turn on Require users to sign in."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1002,"id":9620002,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company builds four agents in Copilot Studio for different audiences. Each agent has its own audience, channel, and data access needs.<\/p><p>You need to choose the authentication configuration for each agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which configuration should you use for each agent? To answer, drag the appropriate configuration to each agent. Each configuration may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1003,"id":9620003,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company runs a voice-enabled agent built in Copilot Studio that is connected to Dynamics 365 Contact Center through the Telephony channel. The same agent is also published to the company website. A Message node reads a 10-digit case number to the caller.<\/p><p>Callers report that the case number is spoken too quickly to write down. The company has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>The text shown in the website chat must not change.<\/li><li>On the phone, the agent must pause between groups of digits and speak the number more slowly.<\/li><li>The change must be limited to the Message node.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Add two message variations that insert spaces between the groups of digits."},{"k":"B","html":"Add a speech override to the Message node and wrap the case number in SSML break and prosody tags in the spoken message."},{"k":"C","html":"Turn on Allow barge-in in the Message node properties."},{"k":"D","html":"Increase the Utterance end timeout in the agent's Voice settings."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1004,"id":9620004,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company uses a generative answers node in a topic of an agent built in Copilot Studio. The agent is published to Microsoft Teams.<\/p><p>The company has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>The generated answer must be displayed inside a branded Adaptive Card instead of as plain text.<\/li><li>The card must show the answer text that the node generated for the current question.<\/li><li>The topic must not send the answer twice.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to configure the topic.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"In the Advanced section of the generative answers node properties, store the answer in a variable and clear Send a message."},{"k":"B","html":"Turn on Search only selected sources in the generative answers node properties."},{"k":"C","html":"Add a Message node with an Adaptive Card, switch the card to Formula, and reference the answer variable in the Power Fx formula."},{"k":"D","html":"Add an Ask with Adaptive Card node that displays the answer variable and has no submit button."},{"k":"E","html":"Set the content moderation level of the generative answers node to Lowest."}],"answer":"AC","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1005,"id":9620005,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company builds an agent in Copilot Studio. A topic stores the customer's name in Topic.CustomerName and the number of open orders in Topic.OpenOrders. The topic must then show an interactive Adaptive Card that greets the customer by name, states the number of open orders, and asks the customer to confirm the shipping address in an input field with a Submit button.<\/p><p>The card was designed in the Adaptive Card designer and currently contains hard-coded text.<\/p><p>You need to make the card show the values from the topic variables.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"In the card payload editor, type the variable names inside the JSON text values."},{"k":"B","html":"In the Adaptive Card node properties, switch from JSON to Formula and replace the hard-coded strings with Topic.CustomerName and Topic.OpenOrders in the Power Fx formula."},{"k":"C","html":"Select Edit Schema in the Adaptive Card node properties and add Topic.CustomerName and Topic.OpenOrders as outputs."},{"k":"D","html":"Move the card to a Message node and add a Set variable value node after it to assign the input values."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1006,"id":9620006,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company builds an order agent in Copilot Studio. A topic shows two interactive Adaptive Cards in sequence: the first collects a delivery date and a delivery note, and the second asks the customer to confirm the order summary. The agent is published to Microsoft Teams and to the company website.<\/p><p>During testing, the team observes the following:<\/p><ul><li>When a user selects Submit on the first card after the second card appears, the topic processes the wrong submission.<\/li><li>The values entered on the first card are not available as variables later in the topic.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to resolve the issues.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Build each card with an Ask with Adaptive Card node so that Copilot Studio creates output variables from the card's input fields."},{"k":"B","html":"Add a unique identifier to the data payload of each card's Action.Submit and check that identifier in a Condition node before processing the submission."},{"k":"C","html":"Add both cards to Message nodes and read the submitted values from System.Activity.Text."},{"k":"D","html":"Set How many reprompts to Don't repeat on both card nodes."},{"k":"E","html":"Change the cards' schema version to 1.6 and replace Action.Submit with Action.Execute."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1007,"id":9620007,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company builds an agent in Copilot Studio. The Greeting topic asks for the customer's email address and then redirects to the Track Order topic. The Track Order topic also contains a Question node that asks for the email address, because users can trigger it directly.<\/p><p>The company has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>When the Greeting topic redirects to Track Order, the agent must not ask for the email address again.<\/li><li>When a user triggers Track Order directly, the agent must still ask for the email address.<\/li><li>The number of global variables must be minimized.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to configure the variables.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Change the Greeting topic's email variable to Global (any topic can access) and insert it in the Track Order topic's messages."},{"k":"B","html":"In the Track Order topic, set the email variable to Receive values from other topics, and in the Greeting topic's Redirect node add that variable as an input mapped to the Greeting topic's email variable."},{"k":"C","html":"In the Track Order topic, add a Set variable value node that copies the Greeting topic's email variable into the Track Order variable."},{"k":"D","html":"In the Track Order topic, set the Question node's Skip behavior to Ask every time."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1008,"id":9620008,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>A company embeds an agent built in Copilot Studio in its customer portal by using the custom website channel. The agent uses the No authentication option. Customers are already signed in to the portal, and the portal knows each customer's first name.<\/p><p>The agent must greet the customer by first name in the Conversation Start topic without asking for it. A maker created a variable named FirstName in a Set variable value node of a dedicated context topic.<\/p><p>You need to configure the agent and the portal.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Insert the System.User.DisplayName variable in the greeting message."},{"k":"B","html":"Make FirstName a global variable with External sources can set values selected, and have the portal pass FirstName=Ana as a query string parameter of the agent URL."},{"k":"C","html":"Make FirstName a global variable with External sources can set values selected, and have the portal pass Global.FirstName=Ana as a query string parameter of the agent URL."},{"k":"D","html":"Create a Text environment variable named FirstName and have the portal set its value when the chat loads."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1009,"id":9620009,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company has a Fabric data agent that answers questions about a sales semantic model. The company wants an agent built in Copilot Studio that uses generative orchestration to delegate sales metric questions to the Fabric data agent. Both agents are in the same tenant.<\/p><p>You need to connect the Fabric data agent to the Copilot Studio agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">In which order should you perform the actions? To answer, move all actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1010,"id":9620010,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company connects a Fabric data agent to an agent built in Copilot Studio that regional sales managers use in Microsoft Teams. The semantic model behind the Fabric data agent enforces row-level security so that each manager can see only their own region.<\/p><p>During testing, every manager receives figures for all regions, which match what the maker who created the connection can see.<\/p><p>You need to ensure that each manager sees only the data that they are authorized to see. The solution must minimize changes to the agent.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Keep Agent author authentication on the connected agent and add the managers to the maker's row-level security role in Fabric."},{"k":"B","html":"In the connected Fabric data agent's additional details, select User authentication, and give the managers at least read access to the Fabric data agent and its underlying data sources."},{"k":"C","html":"Change the Copilot Studio agent's authentication to Authenticate manually with the Generic OAuth 2 service provider."},{"k":"D","html":"Disconnect the Fabric data agent and add the semantic model's tables as a knowledge source instead."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1011,"id":9620011,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company connects an agent built in Copilot Studio to Application Insights by entering the connection string on the agent's Settings &gt; Advanced page. The agent is published to the company website without authentication.<\/p><p>The company has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Kusto queries must exclude conversations that happened in the Copilot Studio test pane.<\/li><li>An event must be logged each time a node in a topic runs.<\/li><li>The daily count of distinct users of the website channel must be accurate.<\/li><li>Makers in the Finance environment must be prevented from turning on agent-level Application Insights telemetry.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to configure the solution.<\/p><p>What should you configure for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1012,"id":9620012,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>A company runs 40 agents built in Copilot Studio in a managed Power Platform environment. The platform team has the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Telemetry for all agents in the environment must be collected in a single Application Insights resource.<\/li><li>Agent invocations, tool executions, and agent outputs must be captured as OpenTelemetry-aligned spans so that the team can trace a turn end to end.<\/li><li>The configuration must be done once by an administrator rather than by each maker.<\/li><\/ul><p>You need to configure monitoring.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Ask each maker to enter the Application Insights connection string on the agent's Settings &gt; Advanced page and turn on Node execution events."},{"k":"B","html":"In the Power Platform admin center, create an Application Insights data export package with the export type Copilot Studio for the environment."},{"k":"C","html":"Open the Copilot Studio Dashboard workbook in Application Insights and share it with the platform team."},{"k":"D","html":"Configure Microsoft Sentinel to collect the Copilot Studio audit logs for the environment."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true}],"cases":{"x-tailspin":{"name":"Tailspin Insurance","html":"<h5>Background<\/h5><p>Tailspin Insurance is a Seattle-based property and casualty insurer that sells home and auto policies directly to consumers. The company handles first notice of loss (FNOL), claim status inquiries, and coverage questions through its website, its mobile app, and a team of 400 claims adjusters.<\/p><p>Tailspin Insurance is building two agents in Microsoft Copilot Studio:<\/p><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Policy Assistant:<\/strong> an external agent for policyholders and prospects that answers coverage questions, reports a loss, and shows claim status.<\/li><li><strong>Adjuster Desk:<\/strong> an internal agent for claims adjusters that looks up claims, reports claims metrics, and summarizes coverage guidance.<\/li><\/ul><p>The project is led by a platform team that owns environments, data policies, and monitoring, and by two maker teams that own the agents. The legal and compliance team oversees privacy, retention, and eDiscovery.<\/p><h5>Current environment<\/h5><h6>Channels<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Public website:<\/strong> Policy Assistant is embedded in pages of tailspin.com.<\/li><li><strong>Mobile app:<\/strong> The native iOS and Android app renders its own chat UI and gets a Direct Line token from the agent's token endpoint.<\/li><li><strong>Microsoft Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot:<\/strong> Adjusters use Adjuster Desk in Teams and by @mentioning it in Microsoft 365 Copilot chat.<\/li><li><strong>Prebuilt demo site:<\/strong> Product owners try the published Policy Assistant before each release.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Identity and access<\/h6><ul><li>Policyholders sign in with Tailspin ID, the company's consumer identity provider, which is a standard OAuth 2.0 provider.<\/li><li>Adjusters sign in with Microsoft Entra ID and are members of the Claims Adjusters security group.<\/li><li>Adjuster Desk is currently configured with Authenticate manually and the Generic OAuth 2 provider.<\/li><li>Policy Assistant is configured with Authenticate manually and the Generic OAuth 2 provider, with Require users to sign in turned off.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Environments<\/h6><ul><li><strong>Tailspin-Customer:<\/strong> the Power Platform environment that hosts Policy Assistant.<\/li><li><strong>Tailspin-Internal:<\/strong> the Power Platform environment that hosts Adjuster Desk.<\/li><li>Each environment has its own Dev and Test environments and a managed release process.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Data sources<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>ClaimsCore:<\/strong> the claims system, exposed as a REST API through an approved custom connector.<\/li><li><strong>Coverage guides:<\/strong> a SharePoint library of coverage guides, exclusions, and claims handling procedures.<\/li><li><strong>Claims Performance:<\/strong> a Microsoft Fabric workspace with a semantic model used by claims leadership. A Fabric data agent named Claims Metrics is published over the model with a detailed description.<\/li><li><strong>tailspin-agents-ai:<\/strong> an Azure Application Insights resource owned by the operations team.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Integration mechanisms<\/h6><ul><li>The custom connector must be used for ClaimsCore.<\/li><li>The SharePoint library must be used as a knowledge source for coverage guidance.<\/li><li>Metric questions must be delegated to the Claims Metrics Fabric data agent.<\/li><li>No custom code is permitted in topics; only Copilot Studio nodes and Power Fx formulas may be used.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Business requirements<\/h5><ul><li>Prospects must be able to ask general coverage questions on the website without signing in.<\/li><li>Claim status and reporting a loss require the policyholder to sign in with Tailspin ID, and calls to ClaimsCore must use the signed-in policyholder's token.<\/li><li>Only members of the Claims Adjusters security group may chat with Adjuster Desk.<\/li><li>Adjuster Desk must be available in Teams and in Microsoft 365 Copilot, and must not be reachable from the website, the mobile app, or any other Direct Line channel.<\/li><li>Adjuster Desk must greet each adjuster by display name without asking for it.<\/li><li>Loss ratio and open claim count questions must be answered from the Claims Performance semantic model, limited to the data each adjuster is permitted to see in Fabric, and must not be answered generatively from documents.<\/li><li>Product owners must be able to try the published Policy Assistant on a prebuilt page before release; that page must never be shared with customers.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Technical requirements<\/h5><ul><li>The Report a loss topic must collect the loss date and a description on a single card, pre-fill the policy number already captured earlier in the conversation, and make the submitted values available to the topic as variables.<\/li><li>The card must render in Teams and in the website chat.<\/li><li>After a policyholder signs in on tailspin.com, the website already knows the policy number. Policy Assistant must use that value in every topic without asking for it, and must wait no more than three seconds for it before continuing with a default value.<\/li><li>Coverage summaries on the website must use bold headings and bulleted lists.<\/li><li>The Policy Assistant greeting must not read identically from one session to the next, and no extra topics may be added for it.<\/li><li>Policyholders must be able to see which coverage guide an answer came from.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Compliance and security<\/h5><ul><li>Makers in Tailspin-Internal must not be able to publish agents that allow anonymous chat.<\/li><li>Makers in Tailspin-Internal must not be able to publish agents to the website, the mobile app, or any other Direct Line channel.<\/li><li>Both restrictions must be enforced centrally by administrators in the Power Platform admin center, not by instructions to makers.<\/li><li>The compliance team must be able to preserve and export adjuster prompts and responses from Microsoft Purview.<\/li><li>Transcripts of customer conversations may be viewed only by the privacy team.<\/li><li>Sensitive activity properties must not be logged to Application Insights.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Monitoring<\/h5><ul><li>The operations team must see the number of distinct adjusters per channel per day in Azure, excluding conversations from the Copilot Studio test pane.<\/li><li>The operations team must see total conversations, latency, exceptions, and tool usage in Azure without writing queries.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Issues and constraints<\/h5><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Blocked Teams channel:<\/strong> The Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot channel for Adjuster Desk shows as blocked, and adjusters cannot install the agent.<\/li><li><strong>Metric questions in Microsoft 365 Copilot:<\/strong> When adjusters ask loss ratio questions through Microsoft 365 Copilot, the answer is generated from the coverage guides instead of coming from the Fabric data agent.<\/li><li><strong>Repeated policy number prompts:<\/strong> Policy Assistant asks for the policy number in every topic, even though the website already passed it.<\/li><li><strong>Static intake card:<\/strong> The Report a loss card shows fixed text, the policy number is not pre-filled, and the submitted loss date is not available after the card.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Problem statement<\/h5><p>Tailspin Insurance must deliver one external agent and one internal agent that respect the different identity, channel, and data exposure rules of each audience. Administrators must enforce the governance rules centrally, the internal agent must answer metric questions from governed Fabric data, and operations must be able to monitor both agents in Azure. You are the solution architect responsible for correcting the configuration to meet the preceding requirements and constraints.<\/p>"}}},{"code":"AI-103","questions":[{"n":1101,"id":9103101,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You need to implement Describe Photo to meet the technical requirements and the business requirements.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze Image API with the denseCaptions visual feature and use the first returned caption."},{"k":"B","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze Image API with the caption visual feature and set the gender-neutral-caption parameter to true."},{"k":"C","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze Image API with the tags visual feature and join the tag names into a sentence."},{"k":"D","html":"Send each photo to the gpt-4.1 deployment in Project1 with a prompt that asks for alt text without gender terms."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1102,"id":9103102,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You need to implement monitoring for search1 to meet the technical requirements.<\/p><p>What should you use for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1103,"id":9103103,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You need to automate the review of advertiser-submitted images and to handle the sponsored artwork. The solution must meet the security and compliance requirements.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"In Azure Content Safety, create an image incident, add the prohibited-symbol sample images as incident samples, deploy the incident, and include the incident in the image analysis request for each advertiser-submitted image."},{"k":"B","html":"In Azure Content Safety, train a custom categories (standard) model by using the prohibited-symbol sample images, and call analyzeCustomCategory for each advertiser-submitted image."},{"k":"C","html":"Add the names of the prohibited symbols to an Azure Content Safety blocklist and attach the blocklist to the Analyze Image requests."},{"k":"D","html":"Keep the Content Credentials manifest that is attached to every image generated by the gpt-image-1 deployment, and direct readers to the Content Credentials Verify webpage to check it."},{"k":"E","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze Image API with the brands visual feature for each advertiser-submitted image."}],"answer":"AD","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1104,"id":9103104,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You need to implement Photo Desk in cms1 to meet the technical requirements and the security and compliance requirements.<\/p><p>How should you complete the code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><pre><code>from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\n\nproject = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=\"[1]\",\n    credential=DefaultAzureCredential(),\n)\nopenai = project.get_openai_client()\n\ncontent = [{\"type\": \"input_text\", \"text\": question}]\nfor url in photo_urls:  # up to eight photos from the event\n    content.append({\"type\": \"[2]\", \"image_url\": url, \"detail\": \"[3]\"})\n\nresponse = openai.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-4.1\",\n    input=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": content}],\n)\nprint(response.output_text)<\/code><\/pre><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1105,"id":9103105,"topic":5,"stem":"<p>You need to add the clips and the photos to the retrieval solution, improve how the articles are indexed, and connect Agent1 to archive-index. The solution must meet the technical requirements.<\/p><p>Which component should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate components to the correct requirements. Each component may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1106,"id":9103106,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You need to implement Listener Line to meet the technical requirements.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Deploy gpt-4o-audio-preview in Project1, and send a chat completions request whose user message contains a text part with the question and an input_audio part that contains the base64-encoded WAV data with the format set to wav."},{"k":"B","html":"Deploy whisper in Project1, transcribe each voicemail, and then send the transcript and the question to the gpt-4.1 deployment."},{"k":"C","html":"Use the Azure Speech fast transcription API to transcribe each voicemail, and then send the transcript and the question to the gpt-4.1 deployment."},{"k":"D","html":"Send a chat completions request to the gpt-4.1 deployment whose user message contains a text part with the question and an image_url part that references the WAV file."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true,"case":"x-litware"},{"n":1001,"id":9103001,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You have an Azure AI Search service that contains an indexer named indexer1. indexer1 ingests product sheets from Azure Blob Storage into an index that a Microsoft Foundry agent uses for grounding.<\/p><p>The portal shows that the most recent runs of indexer1 completed with a status of Success. However, users report that several recently uploaded product sheets are never returned by the agent.<\/p><p>You need to identify which source documents were not indexed and why.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Call Get Indexer Status and review the errors and warnings of the entries in the execution history."},{"k":"B","html":"Query the AzureActivity table for Get Admin Key operations on the search service."},{"k":"C","html":"Create a metric alert on the Search Latency metric of the search service."},{"k":"D","html":"Instrument the client application to log search events to Application Insights."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1002,"id":9103002,"topic":1,"stem":"<p>You have an Azure AI Search service that provides retrieval for a customer support agent in a Microsoft Foundry project.<\/p><p>You need to meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Identify the search queries that return zero documents so that the index content can be improved.<\/li><li>Be notified when the percentage of queries that the service drops exceeds 5 percent.<\/li><\/ul><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Create a diagnostic setting that routes the OperationLogs category to a Log Analytics workspace, and then query the AzureDiagnostics table for Query.Search operations where Documents_d is 0."},{"k":"B","html":"Create a metric alert on the Throttled search queries percentage metric."},{"k":"C","html":"Create an activity log alert for the Get Admin Key operation."},{"k":"D","html":"Call Get Indexer Status and review the itemsFailed value of the last run."},{"k":"E","html":"Create a debug session for the skillset of the indexer."}],"answer":"AB","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1003,"id":9103003,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You are developing a photo catalog app that uses Azure Vision in Foundry Tools.<\/p><p>For each uploaded photo, the app must display one sentence that describes the whole image, and it must also display short descriptions of the individual regions of the image together with the pixel coordinates of each region. The solution must use a single API call and must NOT require a model deployment.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which visual feature should you request from the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze API?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"caption"},{"k":"B","html":"denseCaptions"},{"k":"C","html":"objects"},{"k":"D","html":"tags"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1004,"id":9103004,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You are building an app for a real estate company that uses a Microsoft Foundry project.<\/p><p>For each property listing, the app must produce a detailed, multi-paragraph description in Japanese that is based on up to eight photos of the property, which must be analyzed together in a single request.<\/p><p>You need to recommend a service.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you recommend?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"the Caption feature of Azure Vision Image Analysis 4.0"},{"k":"B","html":"the Dense Captions feature of Azure Vision Image Analysis 4.0"},{"k":"C","html":"a vision-enabled chat model, such as GPT-4o, called through the Chat Completions API with multiple image_url content parts"},{"k":"D","html":"the Read feature of Azure Vision Image Analysis 4.0"}],"answer":"C","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1005,"id":9103005,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a GPT-4o deployment.<\/p><p>You are building a field-service app in which technicians photograph equipment panels and ask questions such as \"What is the serial number printed on the label?\" The answers must be grounded in the small text that is visible in the photos. Accuracy is more important than cost.<\/p><p>You need to configure the image input of the Chat Completions request.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Set detail to low in the image_url object."},{"k":"B","html":"Set detail to high in the image_url object."},{"k":"C","html":"Remove the detail property so that the model uses a 512x512 version of the image."},{"k":"D","html":"Send the photo as the url of a text content part."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1006,"id":9103006,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a GPT-4o deployment named gpt4o.<\/p><p>You are writing a Python function that answers a question about a locally stored JPEG photo of a control panel. The answer must be based on the fine details of the photo.<\/p><p>How should you complete the code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p><pre><code>with open(\"panel.jpg\", \"rb\") as f:\n    encoded = base64.b64encode(f.read()).decode(\"utf-8\")\n\nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"gpt4o\",\n    messages=[{\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": [\n            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Which safety labels are missing from this panel?\"},\n            {\"type\": [1], \"image_url\": {\"url\": [2], \"detail\": [3]}}\n        ]\n    }],\n    max_tokens=1000\n)<\/code><\/pre>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1007,"id":9103007,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You are developing a content management system for a news website. Editors upload thousands of photos per day.<\/p><p>You need to generate alt text for each photo automatically. The solution must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>The alt text must be a short, human-readable sentence for screen reader users.<\/li><li>The alt text must NOT contain gendered terms such as man or woman.<\/li><li>Development effort must be minimized.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze API with the caption feature and set gender-neutral-caption to true."},{"k":"B","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze API with the denseCaptions feature and concatenate all returned captions."},{"k":"C","html":"Call the Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze API with the read feature and use the extracted text."},{"k":"D","html":"Train a custom image classification model and use the predicted label as the alt text."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1008,"id":9103008,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A publishing company is implementing accessibility features for its image library by using Azure Vision in Foundry Tools and Microsoft Foundry Models.<\/p><p>Which capability should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate capability to each requirement. Each capability may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1009,"id":9103009,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project.<\/p><p>You are building a back-office app that processes recorded customer voicemails. The voicemails are stored as WAV files that are smaller than 20 MB. For each voicemail, the app must produce a written summary and an assessment of the caller's tone of voice, which must be inferred from the audio itself rather than from a transcript. The processing runs in a nightly batch, and no spoken response is required.<\/p><p>You need to choose the model and API.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you use?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview through the Chat Completions API with an input_audio content part"},{"k":"B","html":"gpt-realtime through the Realtime API over WebRTC"},{"k":"C","html":"gpt-4o-mini-tts through the Chat Completions API"},{"k":"D","html":"gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview through the Chat Completions API with an image_url content part that points to the WAV file"}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1010,"id":9103010,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an audio-capable chat model deployment.<\/p><p>You are writing Python code that sends a recorded question to the model and prints the text of the model's spoken answer.<\/p><p>How should you configure the request and read the response? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1011,"id":9103011,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry resource that contains two model deployments: a GPT-4.1 deployment named chat-large and a deployment of a small language model sold directly by Azure named chat-small.<\/p><p>An application uses the OpenAI SDK with the base URL <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.openai.azure.com/openai/v1/<\/code> and calls <code>client.responses.create(model=..., input=...)<\/code>. Calls to chat-large succeed. Calls to chat-small fail with the error <code>400 Model not supported<\/code>.<\/p><p>You need to consume chat-small from the application. The solution must minimize code changes.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Add the api-version=2024-10-21 query parameter to the base URL."},{"k":"B","html":"Call client.chat.completions.create with the same client and the deployment name chat-small."},{"k":"C","html":"Redeploy chat-small by using the Global Standard deployment type."},{"k":"D","html":"Create a second client that targets the <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic<\/code> endpoint."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1012,"id":9103012,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent built by using the Foundry Agent Service. The agent uses the Azure AI Search tool with a project connection to an index named products-index. The index contains searchable text fields, searchable vector fields that have a vectorizer, and a semantic configuration.<\/p><p>The tool is currently defined with <code>query_type<\/code> set to <code>simple<\/code>.<\/p><p>You need to ensure that the agent retrieves content by combining keyword search, vector search, and semantic reranking, and that every answer includes a citation that links to the source document.<\/p><p>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Set query_type to vector_semantic_hybrid."},{"k":"B","html":"Set query_type to vector."},{"k":"C","html":"Ensure that the index has a retrievable field that contains the source URL of each document."},{"k":"D","html":"Set top_k to 1."},{"k":"E","html":"Assign the Search Index Data Reader role to each end user of the agent."}],"answer":"AC","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1013,"id":9103013,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You have a Python application that uses the Foundry SDK. The application creates an <code>AIProjectClient<\/code> with the project endpoint <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/&lt;project&gt;<\/code> and <code>DefaultAzureCredential<\/code>, and then calls <code>project.get_openai_client()<\/code> to run the Responses API with the file search tool.<\/p><p>You add a feature that must generate text-embedding-3-large embeddings for documents before they are written to an Azure AI Search index. The solution must continue to use keyless authentication.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Call embeddings.create on the OpenAI-compatible client returned by get_openai_client()."},{"k":"B","html":"Create an OpenAI client whose base_url is <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.openai.azure.com/openai/v1/<\/code> with a bearer token provider for the <code>https://ai.azure.com/.default<\/code> scope, and call embeddings.create on that client."},{"k":"C","html":"Create an Anthropic client that targets <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic<\/code> and call embeddings on it."},{"k":"D","html":"Call the Foundry Tools endpoint <code>https://&lt;resource&gt;.cognitiveservices.azure.com/<\/code> by using the Azure AI Vision SDK."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1014,"id":9103014,"topic":2,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a model router deployment. The deployment uses the default configuration, which routes across all supported underlying models.<\/p><p>Some requests that contain very long documents intermittently fail with a context exceeded error, while identical requests sometimes succeed.<\/p><p>You need to eliminate the failures. The solution must continue to route each request to the most suitable model.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Change the routing mode to Quality."},{"k":"B","html":"Configure a model subset that contains only underlying models whose context window is large enough for the requests."},{"k":"C","html":"Enable automatic version upgrades for the model router deployment."},{"k":"D","html":"Change the deployment type from Global Standard to Data Zone Standard."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1015,"id":9103015,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a Sora 2 deployment.<\/p><p>You are building a marketing tool that generates a landscape video clip from a product photo. The clip must be as long as the model allows, and the product photo must be used as the visual anchor for the first frame.<\/p><p>How should you configure the video creation request? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"hotspot","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1016,"id":9103016,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a Sora 2 deployment.<\/p><p>A designer generated a video of a car driving along a coastal road. The designer now needs a version in which the car is red, while the camera framing, the motion, and the overall structure of the original video remain the same.<\/p><p>You need to produce the new version. The solution must minimize changes to the original video.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Submit the original prompt again with the color changed and the same seconds and size values."},{"k":"B","html":"Submit a new video creation request that sets remix_video_id to the ID of the completed video and describes the color change in the prompt."},{"k":"C","html":"Download the original MP4 and submit it as the input_reference of a new request."},{"k":"D","html":"Send a frame of the original video to the gpt-image-1 edits endpoint with a mask that covers the car."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1017,"id":9103017,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>A company uses a gpt-image-1 deployment in a Microsoft Foundry project to produce product artwork.<\/p><p>Which request parameter should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate parameter to each requirement. Each parameter may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1018,"id":9103018,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project.<\/p><p>A finance team uploads photos of printed business charts. For each photo, you must return a JSON object that contains the chart title and the chart type, where the chart type must be exactly one of bar, line, or pie. The solution must NOT require training a model.<\/p><p>You plan to use Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Analyze each photo with the prebuilt-imageSearch analyzer."},{"k":"B","html":"Analyze each photo with the prebuilt-layout analyzer."},{"k":"C","html":"Create a custom analyzer that uses prebuilt-image as the baseAnalyzerId and defines a fieldSchema with a string field for the title and a classify field with an enum of bar, line, and pie."},{"k":"D","html":"Call the Azure Vision Image Analysis 4.0 Analyze API with the tags feature."}],"answer":"C","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1019,"id":9103019,"topic":3,"stem":"<p>You have an app in which users upload images to a community gallery. The app already uses the Azure AI Content Safety Analyze Image API to block images that are flagged for hate, sexual, violence, or self-harm content.<\/p><p>A new brand policy prohibits images that contain a specific symbol used by a competitor. The legal team has provided eight sample images of the symbol. Enforcement must begin within hours, and the solution must use Azure AI Content Safety.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Add the name of the competitor to a text blocklist and attach the blocklist to the Analyze Image requests."},{"k":"B","html":"Create an image incident by using the custom categories (rapid) API, add the sample images to the incident, deploy the incident, and call image:detectIncidents for each uploaded image."},{"k":"C","html":"Enable Prompt Shields for documents on the uploaded images."},{"k":"D","html":"Lower the severity threshold of the Hate category in the Analyze Image requests."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1020,"id":9103020,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You have an e-commerce app that stores product descriptions as HTML fragments in English.<\/p><p>You need to translate the descriptions into German and Italian by using the Azure Translator Text Translation API v3. The solution must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Both target languages must be returned by a single request.<\/li><li>The HTML tags must be preserved.<\/li><li>Terminology from a Custom Translator model whose Category ID is a1b2c3 must be used.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"ask\">Which query string should you append to the /translate endpoint?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"<code>api-version=3.0&amp;from=en&amp;to=de,it&amp;textType=html<\/code>"},{"k":"B","html":"<code>api-version=3.0&amp;from=en&amp;to=de&amp;to=it&amp;textType=html&amp;category=a1b2c3<\/code>"},{"k":"C","html":"<code>api-version=3.0&amp;from=en&amp;to=de&amp;to=it&amp;textType=plain&amp;category=general<\/code>"},{"k":"D","html":"<code>api-version=3.0&amp;from=en&amp;to=de&amp;to=it&amp;textType=html&amp;allowFallback=false<\/code>"}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1021,"id":9103021,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a GPT-4.1 deployment. The deployment generates compliance summaries of audit reports.<\/p><p>Every summary must follow the same section structure, use the regulatory terminology of your industry, and omit speculative statements. Currently, the prompt contains 12 full-length example summaries, which increases cost and latency. You have 3,000 approved pairs of audit reports and corresponding summaries.<\/p><p>You need to make the summaries consistent while reducing the prompt length.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Run a supervised fine-tuning (SFT) job on GPT-4.1 by using a JSONL file in which each line contains the messages of an audit report prompt and its approved summary, and then deploy the fine-tuned model."},{"k":"B","html":"Run a reinforcement fine-tuning (RFT) job on GPT-4.1 with a grader that scores summaries."},{"k":"C","html":"Run a direct preference optimization (DPO) job on GPT-4.1 by using the approved summaries as both the preferred and the rejected responses."},{"k":"D","html":"Increase the temperature parameter and keep the examples in the prompt."}],"answer":"A","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1022,"id":9103022,"topic":4,"stem":"<p>You are building a Python kiosk app that uses Azure Speech in Foundry Tools.<\/p><p>A visitor speaks English into the microphone. The app must display the French and German translations as text and must also save a synthesized French audio file and a synthesized German audio file of the translations. The solution must minimize development effort.<\/p><p class=\"ask\">What should you do?<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"Set voice_name on the SpeechTranslationConfig, add both target languages, and save the audio from the synthesizing event."},{"k":"B","html":"Add both target languages to the SpeechTranslationConfig, and for each entry in result.translations create a SpeechSynthesizer with speech_synthesis_voice_name set for that language and call speak_text_async."},{"k":"C","html":"Set speech_recognition_language to fr and then to de on the SpeechTranslationConfig."},{"k":"D","html":"Use a SpeechRecognizer to transcribe the speech, call the Translator Text API for each language, and then synthesize each result with a SpeechSynthesizer."}],"answer":"B","answerHtml":"","type":"single","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1023,"id":9103023,"topic":5,"stem":"<p>You have an Azure AI Search service and an Azure Blob Storage container that stores PDF maintenance manuals. The manuals contain text and many wiring diagrams.<\/p><p>You plan to use an indexer and a skillset to ingest the manuals. The solution must meet the following requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Text and the inline images of each manual must be extracted during indexing.<\/li><li>Users must be able to search by typing text and also by uploading a photo of a diagram (image-to-vector queries).<\/li><\/ul><p>Which two skills should you include in the skillset? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<\/p><p>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<\/p>","choices":[{"k":"A","html":"the Azure Content Understanding skill"},{"k":"B","html":"the GenAI Prompt skill"},{"k":"C","html":"the Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill with a matching Azure Vision vectorizer in the index"},{"k":"D","html":"the Entity Recognition skill"},{"k":"E","html":"the AzureOpenAIEmbedding skill attached to text-embedding-3-large"}],"answer":"AC","answerHtml":"","type":"multi","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true},{"n":1024,"id":9103024,"topic":5,"stem":"<p>You have an Azure AI Search service and a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent built by using the Foundry Agent Service.<\/p><p>You need to connect the agent to agentic retrieval over your own content by using an Azure AI Search knowledge base that is exposed to the agent through the Model Context Protocol (MCP).<\/p><p class=\"ask\">Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.<\/p>","choices":[],"answer":"","answerHtml":"","type":"dragdrop","votes":[],"comments":[],"page":0,"thread":"","extra":true}],"cases":{"x-litware":{"name":"Litware Media","html":"<h5>Overview<\/h5><p>Litware Media is a digital publishing company headquartered in Amsterdam. Litware operates a news website, a short-form video channel, and a podcast network. Litware builds, deploys, and manages its generative AI and agent-based solutions by using Microsoft Foundry.<\/p><p>Litware uses Microsoft Entra ID for identity management, authentication, and authorization. The editorial staff belong to a team named Newsroom Team. A separate team named Trust and Safety Team reviews advertiser-submitted images before the images are published.<\/p><h5>Existing environment<\/h5><h6>Microsoft Foundry<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>Foundry1:<\/strong> A Microsoft Foundry resource deployed to the West Europe region. Foundry1 contains two projects named Project1 and Project2. Foundry Tools, including Azure Vision, Azure Content Safety, and Azure Content Understanding, are used through Foundry1.<\/li><li><strong>Project1:<\/strong> Used by the Newsroom Team. Project1 contains two Foundry Models deployments: a gpt-4.1 deployment named gpt-4.1 and a text-embedding-3-large deployment. Project1 contains a project connection named search1-conn that connects to search1 by using the managed identity of Project1 (Microsoft Entra ID authentication).<\/li><li><strong>Agent1:<\/strong> A Foundry Agent Service agent in Project1 that is intended to help editors find archived content. Agent1 does NOT have any knowledge tools and answers only from the general knowledge of its base model.<\/li><li><strong>Project2:<\/strong> Used by the Trust and Safety Team and by the design team. Project2 contains a gpt-image-1 deployment that the design team uses to generate sponsored artwork.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Azure resources<\/h6><ul class=\"kv\"><li><strong>storage1:<\/strong> An Azure Blob Storage account that contains the following containers: articles (PDF article layouts that contain embedded charts and tables that span multiple pages), photos (JPEG photos, approximately two million, with several thousand uploaded daily), clips (MP4 news clips between 30 seconds and five minutes long that contain narration), podcasts (MP3 episodes up to 90 minutes long), and voicemail (WAV recordings of listener voicemails, each less than 10 MB).<\/li><li><strong>search1:<\/strong> An Azure AI Search service on the Standard tier. search1 contains an index named archive-index. An indexer named indexer1 populates archive-index from the articles container by using a skillset named skillset1. archive-index contains searchable text fields and a vector field and has a semantic configuration. Public network access to search1 is disabled. Diagnostic settings are NOT configured for search1.<\/li><li><strong>cms1:<\/strong> The Litware content management system (CMS), a Python web app hosted on Azure App Service. Editors use cms1 to publish articles, photos, clips, and podcasts. cms1 has a system-assigned managed identity.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Planned changes<\/h5><p>Litware plans to implement the following changes:<\/p><ul><li>Add a feature named Describe Photo to cms1 that generates alt text for every photo published on the website.<\/li><li>Add a feature named Photo Desk to cms1 that lets an editor ask questions about a set of photos taken at a single event.<\/li><li>Add the content of the clips container to archive-index, and let editors find photos that resemble a photo they upload.<\/li><li>Connect Agent1 to archive-index.<\/li><li>Automate the review of advertiser-submitted images.<\/li><li>Add a feature named Listener Line to cms1 that answers questions about listener voicemails.<\/li><li>Implement monitoring for search1.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Business requirements<\/h5><p>Litware identifies the following business requirements:<\/p><ul><li>Editors must be able to find archived content by asking Agent1 natural language questions, and the responses of Agent1 must include citations to the indexed sources.<\/li><li>Every photo published on the website must have alt text so that screen readers can describe the photo to blind and low-vision readers.<\/li><li>Advertiser-submitted images must be reviewed automatically before publication. The list of prohibited symbols changes weekly.<\/li><li>Readers must be able to verify that sponsored artwork generated by Litware is AI-generated.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Technical requirements<\/h5><p>Litware identifies the following technical requirements:<\/p><ul><li>The alt text generated by Describe Photo must be a single sentence in English that describes the whole photo, must NOT contain gender terms such as man or woman, and must be produced by a single Foundry Tools API call that does NOT require a model deployment.<\/li><li>Photo Desk must accept up to eight photos from one event in a single request together with a question. The answer must be based only on what is visible in the photos, and small details such as jersey numbers and signage text must be read accurately. cms1 must call the model through the Project1 endpoint by using its managed identity.<\/li><li>Each clip must be split into segments. Each segment must have a natural-language description that combines the visual content and the speech, and a WebVTT transcript. The output must be usable by archive-index without custom post-processing.<\/li><li>For the articles, tables that span multiple pages must be extracted as a single unit, and the embedded charts must receive AI-generated descriptions that are inlined into the Markdown chunks that are indexed.<\/li><li>Editors must be able to search the photos by using a photo as the query.<\/li><li>Agent1 must query archive-index by using search1-conn, must run a hybrid (vector and keyword) query with semantic ranking, and must NOT require custom retrieval code.<\/li><li>Listener Line must answer a text question about what a caller said and about the tone of the caller in a single chat completions request that receives the WAV file directly, without a separate speech-to-text step.<\/li><li>The Newsroom Team must be able to identify which PDF files indexer1 did not index, and the reason, even when the status of the indexer run is Success.<\/li><li>The Newsroom Team must be alerted when skill executions in skillset1 fail, and the alert must identify the skill by name.<\/li><li>The Newsroom Team must be alerted when the average query response time of search1 exceeds two seconds.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Security and compliance requirements<\/h5><p>Litware identifies the following security and compliance requirements:<\/p><ul><li>API keys must NOT be used to access search1 or the Foundry Models deployments.<\/li><li>cms1 must authenticate to Foundry1 by using its managed identity.<\/li><li>An advertiser-submitted image that contains any symbol on the prohibited-symbol list must be rejected. The list consists of sample images, not text. Updates to the list must take effect within hours and must NOT require training a model.<\/li><li>Advertiser-submitted images must also be checked for sexual, violent, hateful, and self-harm content in the same review.<\/li><li>Sponsored artwork generated by the gpt-image-1 deployment must carry tamper-evident provenance information that a reader can verify.<\/li><\/ul><h5>Issues<\/h5><p>Litware identifies the following issues:<\/p><ul><li>The most recent run of indexer1 has a status of Success, but several PDF files uploaded to the articles container last week are never returned by queries against archive-index.<\/li><li>A prototype of Describe Photo produced alt text that described an adult woman as a girl.<\/li><li>An advertiser-submitted image that contained a prohibited symbol was published last month because the review was performed manually.<\/li><li>Agent1 cannot answer questions about the archived content.<\/li><\/ul>"}}}],"areas":{"9100103":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Design element"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Supervisors review and accept the claim records that the Claims Desk agent proposes, inside the Cold Chain Operations app, and the agent waits for a supervisor when it cannot decide","options":["Add the Power Apps MCP server as a tool of the agent and add the agent to the agent feed of the app","Configure the agent as the app assistant agent of the app","Embed the agent in a canvas app by using the Copilot control"],"answer":"Add the Power Apps MCP server as a tool of the agent and add the agent to the agent feed of the app"},{"type":"row","label":"The lane profitability page is generated as TypeScript and React code that developers edit in Visual Studio Code and deploy with PAC CLI, in the Western Europe environment","options":["A generative page created with AI code generation tools","A generative page created in the Power Apps designer at make.powerapps.com","A custom page created in the canvas app designer"],"answer":"A generative page created with AI code generation tools"},{"type":"row","label":"Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales answers sellers' document questions only from the Product Specifications and Price Lists folders","options":["Configure SharePoint locations under Knowledge sources in the Copilot settings of the Sales Hub app","Add a Microsoft 365 Copilot connector for SharePoint","Add the folders as a knowledge source of a Copilot Studio agent"],"answer":"Configure SharePoint locations under Knowledge sources in the Copilot settings of the Sales Hub app"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1103},"9100104":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Model strategies","pool":["A model router deployment in Balanced mode with a model subset","A model router deployment in Quality mode with a model subset","A model router deployment in Cost mode with a model subset","A small language model fine-tuned on the labeled damage notes and run on the device with Foundry Local","The orchestrator and foundation models of Microsoft 365 Copilot","Retrieval-augmented generation over Azure AI Search with a general-purpose model"],"title":"Workloads","head":["Workload","Model strategy"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Dispatch Exceptions agent: one deployment, the most cost-effective model within one to two percent of the best quality for each prompt, automatic failover, only approved models","answer":"A model router deployment in Balanced mode with a model subset"},{"type":"row","label":"Damage-code classifier: offline on the handheld, always exactly one of the 40 internal codes, trained from 3,000 labeled notes, no per-token cost","answer":"A small language model fine-tuned on the labeled damage notes and run on the device with Foundry Local"},{"type":"row","label":"Tender Desk assistant: answers from the Rate Cards and Contracts site with no additional hosting","answer":"The orchestrator and foundation models of Microsoft 365 Copilot"},{"type":"row","label":"Legal contract clause review: the highest-quality model for each prompt regardless of cost, only approved models","answer":"A model router deployment in Quality mode with a model subset"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1104},"9100003":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Agents","pool":["Sales Qualification Agent","Sales Research Agent","Account Reconciliation Agent","Supplier Communications Agent","Approvals Agent","Case Management Agent"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Agent"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Research inbound leads and send outreach emails autonomously","answer":"Sales Qualification Agent"},{"type":"row","label":"Evaluate voucher amount mismatch exceptions and recommend a journal entry","answer":"Account Reconciliation Agent"},{"type":"row","label":"Draft vendor follow-up emails and update purchase orders from replies","answer":"Supplier Communications Agent"},{"type":"row","label":"Review time and expense entries against policy documents","answer":"Approvals Agent"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1003},"9100024":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Foundry Tools","pool":["Document Intelligence","Content Understanding","Content Safety","Translator","Speech","Azure AI Search"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Foundry Tool"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Extract vendor, customer, and total fields from scanned invoices with a prebuilt model","answer":"Document Intelligence"},{"type":"row","label":"Generate KPIs and summaries from call-center audio and product videos","answer":"Content Understanding"},{"type":"row","label":"Detect and block harmful text in agent responses","answer":"Content Safety"},{"type":"row","label":"Translate knowledge articles into more than 100 languages","answer":"Translator"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1024},"9100031":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Agent"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Cited research report from web and internal work content","options":["Researcher","Employee Self-Service agent","Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot"],"answer":"Researcher"},{"type":"row","label":"HR policy lookup and IT tickets in ServiceNow, customizable in Copilot Studio","options":["Researcher","Employee Self-Service agent","Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot"],"answer":"Employee Self-Service agent"},{"type":"row","label":"Search, synthesize, and act on sales data across Microsoft 365 apps","options":["Researcher","Employee Self-Service agent","Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot"],"answer":"Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1031},"9100036":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Method"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"About 10 questions from the description and instructions","options":["Quick question set","Full question set","Create a test set from a theme","Import a CSV file"],"answer":"Quick question set"},{"type":"row","label":"Questions that real users asked about billing and payments","options":["Quick question set","Full question set","Create a test set from a theme","Import a CSV file"],"answer":"Create a test set from a theme"},{"type":"row","label":"60 questions with expected responses kept in a spreadsheet","options":["Quick question set","Full question set","Create a test set from a theme","Import a CSV file"],"answer":"Import a CSV file"}],"exam":"AB-100","n":1036},"9620102":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Channels","pool":["Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot","Custom website","Mobile app","Demo website","SharePoint"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Channel"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Adjusters use Adjuster Desk in Teams and by @mentioning it in Microsoft 365 Copilot chat.","answer":"Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot"},{"type":"row","label":"Policyholders chat with Policy Assistant inside pages of tailspin.com.","answer":"Custom website"},{"type":"row","label":"The native iOS and Android app renders its own chat UI and gets a Direct Line token from the agent's token endpoint.","answer":"Mobile app"},{"type":"row","label":"Product owners try the published Policy Assistant on a prebuilt page that is never shared with customers.","answer":"Demo website"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1102},"9620103":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Action"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Prevent makers in Tailspin-Internal from publishing agents that allow anonymous chat","options":["Block the Chat without Microsoft Entra ID authentication in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal","Turn on Require users to sign in on each agent in Tailspin-Internal","Block the Microsoft Teams + Microsoft 365 Channel in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal"],"answer":"Block the Chat without Microsoft Entra ID authentication in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal"},{"type":"row","label":"Prevent makers in Tailspin-Internal from publishing agents to the website, the mobile app, or any other Direct Line channel","options":["Block the Direct Line channels in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal","Block the SharePoint channel in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal","Ask makers to remove the Custom website and Mobile app channels before publishing"],"answer":"Block the Direct Line channels in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal"},{"type":"row","label":"Let the compliance team preserve and export adjuster prompts and responses from Microsoft Purview","options":["Create an eDiscovery case and search for items whose ItemClass is IPM.SkypeTeams.Message.Copilot.Studio.*","Turn on Log conversation details in the agent's Application Insights settings","Assign the Bot Transcript Viewer security role to the compliance team"],"answer":"Create an eDiscovery case and search for items whose ItemClass is IPM.SkypeTeams.Message.Copilot.Studio.*"},{"type":"row","label":"Ensure that only the privacy team can view transcripts of customer conversations","options":["Keep Policy Assistant in the separate Tailspin-Customer environment and assign the Bot Transcript Viewer security role there only to the privacy team","Share Policy Assistant with the privacy team for collaborative authoring","Block the Microsoft Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Customer"],"answer":"Keep Policy Assistant in the separate Tailspin-Customer environment and assign the Bot Transcript Viewer security role there only to the privacy team"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1103},"9620105":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Action"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"The Policy Assistant greeting must not read identically from one session to the next, without adding topics","options":["Add message variations to the greeting Message node","Add quick replies to the greeting Message node","Add a speech override to the greeting Message node"],"answer":"Add message variations to the greeting Message node"},{"type":"row","label":"Coverage summaries on the website must use bold headings and bulleted lists","options":["Use Markdown formatting in the Message node","Insert HTML heading and list tags in the Message node","Add the summary as an image in the Message node"],"answer":"Use Markdown formatting in the Message node"},{"type":"row","label":"Policyholders must be able to see which coverage guide an answer came from","options":["Answer from the SharePoint knowledge source with a standard generative answers node so that citations are included","Paste the SharePoint library URL at the end of every Message node","Add a basic card that names the library"],"answer":"Answer from the SharePoint knowledge source with a standard generative answers node so that citations are included"},{"type":"row","label":"Adjuster Desk must greet each adjuster by display name without asking for it","options":["Insert the User.DisplayName variable into the greeting Message node","Insert the User.AccessToken variable into the greeting Message node","Add a Question node that identifies a Person name before the greeting"],"answer":"Insert the User.DisplayName variable into the greeting Message node"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1105},"9620106":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Action"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Answer loss ratio and open claim questions from the Claims Performance semantic model, limited to the data each adjuster may see in Fabric","options":["On the Agents page add the Claims Metrics Fabric data agent as a connected agent and set its authentication to User authentication","On the Agents page add the Claims Metrics Fabric data agent as a connected agent and set its authentication to Agent author authentication","Add the Claims Performance semantic model as a knowledge source"],"answer":"On the Agents page add the Claims Metrics Fabric data agent as a connected agent and set its authentication to User authentication"},{"type":"row","label":"Loss ratio questions asked through Microsoft 365 Copilot are answered from the coverage guides instead of by the Fabric data agent","options":["Have adjusters ask metric questions in Teams, because a connected Fabric data agent is not supported in Microsoft 365 Copilot","Add a Redirect node in a topic that points to the Fabric data agent","Switch Adjuster Desk to classic orchestration"],"answer":"Have adjusters ask metric questions in Teams, because a connected Fabric data agent is not supported in Microsoft 365 Copilot"},{"type":"row","label":"Send Adjuster Desk telemetry to tailspin-agents-ai without logging sensitive activity properties","options":["In Settings > Advanced > Application Insights, enter the connection string and turn on Enable logging","In Settings > Advanced > Application Insights, enter the connection string and turn on Log sensitive Activity properties","Block the Application Insights in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal"],"answer":"In Settings > Advanced > Application Insights, enter the connection string and turn on Enable logging"},{"type":"row","label":"Count distinct adjusters per channel per day, excluding test pane conversations","options":["customEvents | where customDimensions['designMode'] == 'False' | summarize dcount(user_Id) by bin(timestamp, 1d), tostring(customDimensions['channelId'])","dependencies | summarize count() by bin(timestamp, 1d)","customEvents | where customDimensions['channelId'] == 'emulator' | summarize dcount(user_Id) by bin(timestamp, 1d)"],"answer":"customEvents | where customDimensions['designMode'] == 'False' | summarize dcount(user_Id) by bin(timestamp, 1d), tostring(customDimensions['channelId'])"},{"type":"row","label":"Show total conversations, latency, exceptions, and tool usage in Azure without writing queries","options":["Open the Copilot Studio Dashboard workbook under Monitoring > Workbooks in the Application Insights resource","Open the Analytics page of the agent in Copilot Studio","Create a Power BI report over the Dataverse conversation transcript table"],"answer":"Open the Copilot Studio Dashboard workbook under Monitoring > Workbooks in the Application Insights resource"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1106},"9620002":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Configurations","pool":["No authentication","Authenticate with Microsoft","Authenticate manually with Microsoft Entra ID and Require users to sign in turned on","Authenticate manually with Generic OAuth 2 and Require users to sign in turned on"],"title":"Agents","head":["Agent","Configuration"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"An HR policy agent for employees that is published only to Microsoft Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot. Users must be signed in without the maker registering an app in the identity provider.","answer":"Authenticate with Microsoft"},{"type":"row","label":"A store locator agent on the public website. Anyone who opens the page must be able to chat without signing in, and the agent uses only public information.","answer":"No authentication"},{"type":"row","label":"A payroll agent embedded in the company intranet by using the custom website channel. Employees sign in with the company's Microsoft Entra ID, and only the employees the agent is shared with may chat with it.","answer":"Authenticate manually with Microsoft Entra ID and Require users to sign in turned on"},{"type":"row","label":"A loyalty program agent on the public website. Customers sign in with the company's consumer OAuth 2.0 identity provider before chatting, and topics use the customer's access token to call the loyalty API.","answer":"Authenticate manually with Generic OAuth 2 and Require users to sign in turned on"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1002},"9620009":{"kind":"order","poolTitle":"Actions","pool":["In Microsoft Fabric, publish the data agent with a detailed description.","On the Copilot Studio agent's Agents page, select Add an agent and choose Microsoft Fabric under Connect to an external agent.","Select an existing connection to Microsoft Fabric or create a new one.","Select the Fabric data agent from the list and refine its description so the orchestrator knows when to invoke it.","Test in the test pane that metric questions are delegated to the connected agent, then publish the Copilot Studio agent.","Add the sales semantic model to the Copilot Studio agent as a knowledge source.","Add a Redirect node in a topic that points to the Fabric data agent."],"answer":["In Microsoft Fabric, publish the data agent with a detailed description.","On the Copilot Studio agent's Agents page, select Add an agent and choose Microsoft Fabric under Connect to an external agent.","Select an existing connection to Microsoft Fabric or create a new one.","Select the Fabric data agent from the list and refine its description so the orchestrator knows when to invoke it.","Test in the test pane that metric questions are delegated to the connected agent, then publish the Copilot Studio agent."],"exam":"AB-620","n":1009},"9620011":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Option"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Exclude conversations from the Copilot Studio test pane in Kusto queries","options":["Filter on the designMode custom dimension","Filter on the channelId custom dimension","Turn off Enable logging while testing"],"answer":"Filter on the designMode custom dimension"},{"type":"row","label":"Log an event each time a node in a topic runs","options":["Enable logging","Node execution events","Log sensitive Activity properties"],"answer":"Node execution events"},{"type":"row","label":"Get an accurate daily count of distinct users of the website channel","options":["Require users to sign in so that user IDs are consistent across conversations","Turn on Log conversation details","Summarize by the fromName custom dimension"],"answer":"Require users to sign in so that user IDs are consistent across conversations"},{"type":"row","label":"Prevent makers in the Finance environment from turning on agent-level telemetry","options":["Block the Application Insights in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy that applies to the environment","Remove the connection string from each agent in the environment","Turn off Log sensitive Activity properties in each agent"],"answer":"Block the Application Insights in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy that applies to the environment"}],"exam":"AB-620","n":1011},"9103102":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Requirement","Option"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Identify the PDF files that indexer1 did not index, and the reason","options":["The Get Admin Key entries in the activity log","The errors and warnings in the execution history returned by Get Indexer Status","The Search queries per second metric"],"answer":"The errors and warnings in the execution history returned by Get Indexer Status"},{"type":"row","label":"Be alerted when skill executions in skillset1 fail, identified by skill name","options":["A metric alert on Skill execution invocation count, split by the Failed and SkillName dimensions","A metric alert on Throttled search queries percentage","A log alert on Query.Search operations in the AzureDiagnostics table"],"answer":"A metric alert on Skill execution invocation count, split by the Failed and SkillName dimensions"},{"type":"row","label":"Be alerted when the average query response time exceeds two seconds","options":["A metric alert on Document processed count","An activity log alert on Regenerate Admin Key","A metric alert on Search Latency"],"answer":"A metric alert on Search Latency"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1102},"9103104":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Placeholder","Value"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"[1]","options":["https://foundry1.openai.azure.com/openai/v1/","https://foundry1.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/Project1","https://search1.search.windows.net"],"answer":"https://foundry1.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/Project1"},{"type":"row","label":"[2]","options":["input_image","input_file","image_url"],"answer":"input_image"},{"type":"row","label":"[3]","options":["auto","low","high"],"answer":"high"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1104},"9103105":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Components","pool":["The prebuilt-videoSearch analyzer in Azure Content Understanding","The prebuilt-callCenter analyzer in Azure Content Understanding","The Azure Content Understanding skill","The Document Extraction skill","The Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill","The GenAI Prompt skill","The Azure AI Search tool","The File Search tool"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Component"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Split each clip into segments that have a natural-language description of the visual and spoken content and a WebVTT transcript, ready for indexing","answer":"The prebuilt-videoSearch analyzer in Azure Content Understanding"},{"type":"row","label":"Extract the multi-page tables of the articles as a single unit and inline AI-generated chart descriptions into the indexed Markdown chunks","answer":"The Azure Content Understanding skill"},{"type":"row","label":"Let editors search the photos by using a photo as the query","answer":"The Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill"},{"type":"row","label":"Let Agent1 retrieve and cite content from archive-index through search1-conn without custom retrieval code","answer":"The Azure AI Search tool"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1105},"9103006":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Blank","Value"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"[1]","options":["\"image_url\"","\"input_image\"","\"image_file\""],"answer":"\"image_url\""},{"type":"row","label":"[2]","options":["f\"data:image/jpeg;base64,{encoded}\"","encoded","f\"base64:{encoded}\""],"answer":"f\"data:image/jpeg;base64,{encoded}\""},{"type":"row","label":"[3]","options":["\"high\"","\"low\"","\"auto\""],"answer":"\"high\""}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1006},"9103008":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Capabilities","pool":["Image Analysis 4.0 caption","Image Analysis 4.0 denseCaptions","Image Analysis 4.0 read","Image Analysis 4.0 smartCrops","A vision-enabled chat model such as GPT-4o"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Capability"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Provide a one-sentence alt text for each photo without deploying a model.","answer":"Image Analysis 4.0 caption"},{"type":"row","label":"Provide an extended description that lists the regions of an infographic together with the bounding box of each region.","answer":"Image Analysis 4.0 denseCaptions"},{"type":"row","label":"Provide the exact wording printed on a photographed poster so that it can be read aloud.","answer":"Image Analysis 4.0 read"},{"type":"row","label":"Provide a multi-paragraph long description of a complex chart written in German.","answer":"A vision-enabled chat model such as GPT-4o"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1008},"9103010":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Setting","Value"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Model to deploy:","options":["gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview","gpt-4o-mini-tts","gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview"],"answer":"gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview"},{"type":"row","label":"Content part type for the recording:","options":["input_audio","audio_url","input_file"],"answer":"input_audio"},{"type":"row","label":"Response field that contains the text of the spoken answer:","options":["choices[0].message.audio.transcript","choices[0].message.audio.data","choices[0].message.audio.id"],"answer":"choices[0].message.audio.transcript"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1010},"9103015":{"kind":"select","title":"Answer area","head":["Parameter","Value"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"seconds:","options":["4","12","20"],"answer":"12"},{"type":"row","label":"size:","options":["720x1280","1280x720","1920x1080"],"answer":"1280x720"},{"type":"row","label":"Parameter that carries the product photo:","options":["input_reference","remix_video_id","prompt"],"answer":"input_reference"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1015},"9103017":{"kind":"match","poolTitle":"Parameters","pool":["background","output_compression","input_fidelity","partial_images","quality","n"],"title":"Requirements","head":["Requirement","Parameter"],"blocks":[{"type":"row","label":"Generate a PNG logo whose background is transparent.","answer":"background"},{"type":"row","label":"Reduce the file size of a JPEG output image.","answer":"output_compression"},{"type":"row","label":"Preserve the facial features of the person in the input image when editing it.","answer":"input_fidelity"},{"type":"row","label":"Receive up to three intermediate images while a streamed generation is in progress.","answer":"partial_images"}],"exam":"AI-103","n":1017},"9103024":{"kind":"order","poolTitle":"Actions","pool":["Create a search index that meets the requirements for agentic retrieval.","Create a knowledge source of kind searchIndex that wraps the index.","Create a knowledge base that references the knowledge source by name.","Add the MCP endpoint of the knowledge base to the agent as an MCP tool.","Create a knowledge base and list the index name directly in its knowledgeSources.","Add the Azure AI Search tool to the agent and set index_name to the knowledge base name."],"answer":["Create a search index that meets the requirements for agentic retrieval.","Create a knowledge source of kind searchIndex that wraps the index.","Create a knowledge base that references the knowledge source by name.","Add the MCP endpoint of the knowledge base to the agent as an MCP tool."],"exam":"AI-103","n":1024}},"reviewed":{"9100101":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1101,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Microsoft 365 Copilot extensibility","why":"决定性的需求是\"必须运行在 Microsoft 365 Copilot 的 orchestrator 和 foundation models 上、不需要额外 hosting、个人发起、Teams @mention 和 Copilot Chat 中使用、低代码最快交付\"，这正是 Learn 上 declarative agent 的适用条件（复用 Copilot 的编排与模型，继承 Microsoft 365 的合规与 RAI，用 Agent Builder 或 Copilot Studio 低代码构建，在 Teams/Word/Outlook 中运行）。A 和 C 都是 custom engine agent：需要自带 orchestrator/模型、额外 hosting，并自行负责合规，只有在需要主动触发、自定义模型或复杂编排时才值得（那是 Dispatch Exceptions agent 的情况）。D 只在 Dynamics 365 Sales 应用内生效，账户经理无法在 Teams 或 Copilot Chat 中使用。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview","sk":["A2.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy"],"answer":"B"},"9100102":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1102,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Governance, security & compliance","why":"两条需求分别对应两类控制。(1) 隐藏在 carrier 邮件/PDF 里的指令是 indirect prompt injection（document attack），用户改写指令是 user prompt attack；Prompt Shields 在 Foundry 中以 guardrail control 的形式配置，document attack 扫描 user input 和 tool response 两个 intervention point，而且 agent 的风险检测以分配给 agent 的 guardrail 为准（会完全覆盖模型的 guardrail），所以必须把 guardrail 分配到 agent 上。(2) \"非人类身份、不存凭据、不走公网\"对应 CAF Secure AI 的 managed identities 和 Foundry Agent Service 的 private networking。B 错：Spotlighting 只适用于 Chat Completions 的模型，对 agent 不生效（Learn 的适用表标为不支持）。D 错：敏感度标签做数据分类与 DLP，不能检测注入指令。E 错：Violence/Hate 是内容伤害类别而非注入检测，且 agent 不继承模型部署的 guardrail。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection","sk":["C4.4","C4.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/guardrails/guardrails-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/secure"],"answer":"AC"},"9100103":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1103,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"第 1 行：COO 要求\"人工审核后才能建记录、agent 卡住时等待主管\"，这是 agent feed 的两种 human-in-the-loop 模式——Copilot Studio 自主 agent 通过 Power Apps MCP server 的 invoke_data_entry（记录绝不自动创建，主管在 feed 中 Accept and complete）和 request_assistance（任务进入 Needs attention，agent 等待回调）把任务发到模型驱动应用的 agent feed；app assistant agent 只提供聊天主题，Copilot control 是画布应用的聊天控件，都没有审批任务流。第 2 行：Learn 明确 in-browser generative page 只在美国、英国、澳大利亚、新加坡可用，而 AI code generation tools（GitHub Copilot CLI/Claude Code + PAC CLI）的 code-first 方式全球公有云可用、生成 TypeScript/React 并支持 npm install 与 IntelliSense；custom page 是画布设计器，不是生成式页面。第 3 行：Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales 默认搜索卖家能访问的所有 SharePoint 文件夹，要限定范围需在 Sales Hub 的 App Settings > Copilot > Knowledge sources 配置 SharePoint locations；Microsoft 365 Copilot connector 和 Copilot Studio 知识源都不影响 Sales 应用内的 Copilot。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/user/supervise-agents-with-agent-feed","sk":["B1.9","B1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/user/supervise-agents-with-agent-feed","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/model-driven-apps/generative-page-external-tools","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/sales/copilot-sharepoint-config"],"boxes":["Add the Power Apps MCP server as a tool of the agent and add the agent to the agent feed of the app","A generative page created with AI code generation tools","Configure SharePoint locations under Knowledge sources in the Copilot settings of the Sales Hub app"]},"9100104":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1104,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"Model router 是单一部署内按每个请求实时选模型的 optimization layer：Balanced（默认）在与最优模型相差 1–2% 的质量带内选最省钱的模型，Cost 把质量带放宽到 5–6%，Quality 不计成本选最高质量；model subset 是 Learn 推荐的 compliance gate——只路由到 CISO 批准的模型、新模型不显式加入就不会被用，同时 subset 也是 failover 集合（至少两个模型）。手持设备的分类任务满足\"何时该做自定义模型\"的条件：有 3,000 条标注数据、要求输出严格遵循内部 taxonomy、需要低成本低延迟，fine-tuning overview 列出的收益正是 specialize a smaller model、align style and structure、reduce prompt overhead；而离线、零 per-token 成本、数据不离设备是 Foundry Local 的典型场景（用 Olive 编译的 ONNX 模型可在 Foundry Local 运行）。Tender Desk assistant 是 declarative agent，直接用 Microsoft 365 Copilot 的 orchestrator 和模型，不需要自定义模型；RAG over Azure AI Search 需要联网且不满足\"无额外 hosting\"。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router-how-it-works","sk":["A3.4","A2.8","A2.10"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router-how-it-works","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-local/what-is-foundry-local"],"boxes":["A model router deployment in Balanced mode with a model subset","A small language model fine-tuned on the labeled damage notes and run on the device with Foundry Local","The orchestrator and foundation models of Microsoft 365 Copilot","A model router deployment in Quality mode with a model subset"]},"9100105":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1105,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"CAF 的 AI Center of Excellence 指南与案例需求逐条对应：AI CoE 的目的就是防止 fragmented or ungoverned AI adoption；如果已经有 Cloud Center of Excellence，应把 AI 实践与专家融入该团队，只有现有团队无法支撑时才建独立团队（CEO 的\"不要不必要的复杂度与独立团队\"）；处于 AI 早期阶段的公司应先 centralized 以集中专业能力与基础实践，成熟后再转为 advisory；其职责表（define and enforce AI standards、develop reusable assets 如 compliance checklists、measure and report outcomes 如 adoption KPIs）正是\"由单一团队负责治理策略、安全标准、合规清单和采用 KPI\"。A 和 D 都是成熟阶段的 advisory/分散模式，过早采用会让刚起步的组织失去控制与一致性。C 是 Power Platform 环境与应用治理的工具包，不是组织级 AI CoE。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence","sk":["A2.12"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/plan"],"answer":"B"},"9100106":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1106,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing & quality","why":"需求是\"至少 80 个源自 SOP 的问题、QA 不手写、同一测试集跨版本复用、从 pipeline 触发\"。Copilot Studio agent evaluation 的 Full question set 用 agent 的 knowledge source（支持 Text、Word、Excel、PDF、单个 SharePoint 文件，≤5 MB）或 topics 生成测试用例并可选择数量（一个 test set 最多 100 条），保存后同一 test set 可反复运行以得到可比的分数，并且评估可通过 Power Platform REST API 或连接器在 CI/CD pipeline 中触发；案例中 agent 使用 Authenticate with Microsoft，正好满足评估只支持 No authentication 或 Authenticate with Microsoft 的限制。A 错：Quick question set 只根据 agent 的 description/instructions 生成 10 个问题，不基于 SOP 且不足 80 条。C 错：test chat 来源于人工对话、无法复用且是手动运行。D 错：Themes 来自生产用户的真实提问，发布前不存在、也不源自 SOP。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create","sk":["C2.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-intro"],"answer":"B"},"9100001":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1001,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent types & use cases","why":"CAF 的用例识别步骤区分两种 AI 类型：“Nongenerative AI (deterministic) produces consistent and repeatable outputs from structured inputs ... Lean this way for tasks that depend on accuracy such as prediction or anomaly detection”，决策树中用自有数据训练模型选 Microsoft Fabric 或 Azure Machine Learning。生成式 agent（Copilot Studio、declarative agent、model router 背后的 LLM）输出是非确定的，适合邮件起草这类非结构化、允许变化的任务。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy","sk":["A1.1","A2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy"],"answer":"B"},"9100002":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1002,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"CAF Plan 的成熟度表把 Level 1 的可行用例限定为 “Azure quickstart projects” 和 “Any Copilot solution”；RAG 应用属 Level 3，训练 ML 模型属 Level 3，在 VM 上训练运行模型属 Level 3–4。文档还建议 PoC “Start with internal, non-customer-facing projects to limit risk”，并指出 “Microsoft Copilots typically provide the shortest timelines for return on investment (days to weeks)”。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/plan","sk":["A2.1","A2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/plan"],"answer":"A"},"9100003":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1003,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"Sales Qualification Agent “autonomously researching leads, determining if they're a good fit ... sending outreach emails”；Account Reconciliation Agent 评估 “Voucher amount mismatch” 等异常并推荐 “Create journal entry”；Supplier Communications Agent 自动化采购中的供应商沟通与 PO 更新；Approvals Agent 用 Copilot Studio agent 对照上传的政策文档初审 time/expense 条目并标记 Ready for approval 或 Needs review。Sales Research Agent 是用自然语言对话分析销售数据，Case Management Agent 属于 Customer Service。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/copilot/ai-get-started","sk":["A2.4","B3.1","B3.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/copilot/ai-get-started","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/finance/general-ledger/acct-rec-agent","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/sales/ai-agent-overview"],"boxes":["Sales Qualification Agent","Account Reconciliation Agent","Supplier Communications Agent","Approvals Agent"]},"9100004":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1004,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Microsoft 365 Copilot extensibility","why":"Declarative agent 使用 Copilot 自带的 orchestrator 和模型：“Hosting: Use Copilot's orchestrator and foundation model. No additional hosting is required”，并 “Inherits Microsoft 365 compliance, RAI, and security standards”；Agent Builder 可添加 SharePoint 知识源，用户在 Teams 和 Copilot 中按需调用，正是文档建议 “Build a declarative agent when” 的场景。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview","sk":["A2.7","B2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/declarative-agent-tool-comparison"],"answer":"A"},"9100005":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1005,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Microsoft 365 Copilot extensibility","why":"Custom engine agent “Require additional hosting outside of Microsoft 365, typically with cloud services such as Azure, at an additional cost”，而且 “Must ensure your own compliance, RAI practices, and security measures”，同时违反“无额外托管”和“继承 Microsoft 365 合规控制”两项要求。文档把自定义引擎留给需要自有编排、自选模型、主动消息或群组协作的场景。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview","sk":["A2.7","B2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview"],"answer":"B"},"9100006":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1006,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"Foundry 文档明确 fine-tuning 调整权重以学习任务模式，“doesn't replace retrieval for current information”；价格和库存这类每天变化的事实应通过检索（RAG）在推理时注入。无论 SFT、RFT 还是 Developer 训练层级，都需要反复训练并产生 training 与 hosting 成本，而且月度训练仍落后于每日变化。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","sk":["A2.8","B1.11"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy"],"answer":"B"},"9100007":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1007,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"文档列出的 fine-tuning 收益包括 “Align style and structure. Responses can follow a consistent tone, format, or schema” 和 “Reduce prompt overhead. Fewer prompt examples can lower token costs and latency”。时效性政策靠检索而非微调；classic 指南建议 “Start with 50-100 high-quality examples” 并用 held-out 评估，12 条样本不够；安全控制属 guardrails，fine-tuning “doesn't replace ... application-level safety controls”。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","sk":["A2.8","B2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-classic/concepts/fine-tuning-overview"],"answer":"AB"},"9100008":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1008,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Prompt engineering & evaluation","why":"Organizational prompts 由 AI Administrator 或 Search Editor 在 Microsoft 365 admin center 的 Copilot > Prompts 中创建、导入、发布（上限 1,000 条，可置顶 4 条），带 Department 字段，显示为 Suggested、prompt lab 和 autosuggest，并提供 Active users 与 Submissions 分析。Prompt Gallery 的 Teams 共享由最终用户自行保存，不是集中治理；Copilot Studio prompt tool 是 agent 内部能力，不出现在 Copilot Chat 建议中。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/organizational-prompts","sk":["A2.9","B2.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/organizational-prompts","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/copilot-prompt-gallery"],"answer":"B"},"9100009":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1009,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent types & use cases","why":"Foundry Local 的定位是 “Use Foundry Local when you want to run AI locally, work offline, minimize latency, or keep data private”，“There are no per-token costs”，无需 Azure 订阅，模型目录包含 Phi 等为设备优化的 SLM。其余三项都是云端推理，需要联网并把数据送出设备。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-local/what-is-foundry-local","sk":["A2.10","A2.8"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-local/what-is-foundry-local","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/ai/cloud-ai"],"answer":"B"},"9100010":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1010,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"这正是文档中的 “Specialize a smaller model. Teacher-generated examples can help a smaller model meet task requirements at lower cost and latency”（distillation through teacher-generated SFT data）；classic 指南也建议分类这类聚焦任务从 GPT-4.1-mini 等小模型开始，Phi 4 是 “Cost effective option for simpler tasks”。更多 few-shot 和更高 reasoning effort 都会增加 token 与延迟；AI Search 不执行分类。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","sk":["A2.10","B2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-classic/concepts/fine-tuning-overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100011":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1011,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Prompt engineering & evaluation","why":"Foundry 提示工程指南指出模型存在 recency bias，“it's worth experimenting with repeating the instructions at the end of the prompt”（best practice “Double down”）；“Give the model an out”（如 not found）应保留以避免编造；升高 temperature 只会增加随机性；对 reasoning 模型用非官方方式提取思维链 “aren't supported”。Copilot Studio 的 prompt 最佳实践同样要求 be specific、give the agent a way out。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/prompt-engineering","sk":["A2.11","B1.16"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/prompt-engineering","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/nlu-prompt-node"],"answer":"A"},"9100012":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1012,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"CAF：“If you already operate a Cloud Center of Excellence (CCoE), integrate AI practices and expertise into that team. Only create a standalone AI team if current teams can't support AI adoption or if critical risks exist.” 早期阶段文档建议集中式 CoE 以加速采用，分散到产品团队的 advisory 模式是成熟后的演进；外包无法建立内部专家团队。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence","sk":["A2.12","A2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence"],"answer":"B"},"9100013":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1013,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"CAF 的 CoE 职责表包含 “Create intake and prioritization workflows ... Maintain a prioritized AI initiative backlog” 与 “Measure and report outcomes ... adoption rates, compliance levels, and project cycle times. Regularly report insights to leadership”。“Manage AI services” 是可选职责，且 CoE 应随成熟度转向 advisory 而非永久集中运维；早期立即下放治理违背集中原则；决策树是 CoE 应当使用的工具。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence","sk":["A2.12","C1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/center-of-excellence"],"answer":"AB"},"9100014":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1014,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Data preparation & grounding","why":"Dual-write “provides tightly coupled, bidirectional integration between finance and operations apps and Dataverse”，近实时同步客户、产品、库存等，使 Sales 等 customer engagement apps 与 F&O 共享同一份数据。夜间管道不是近实时也不是双向；Copilot connector 用于 Microsoft 365 搜索索引；Data Lake 导出是单向分析用途。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/data-entities/dual-write/dual-write-overview","sk":["A2.13","A1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/data-entities/dual-write/dual-write-overview"],"answer":"B"},"9100015":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1015,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"参考架构指出该模式 “tightly couples with the built-in agent, Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales” 且 “The Copilot APIs directly available in a PCF control only work against Copilot for the currently used app ... works only from Dynamics 365 Sales and not from other apps, such as Dynamics 365 Customer Insights - Journeys or Dynamics 365 Customer Service”。推荐做法是自定义 Copilot Studio agent + Microsoft 365 Agents SDK 的 PCF 控件，实现跨应用一致行为与解耦。Copilot in Sales 支持自定义 topic，Contact 表是跨 CE 应用共享的 Dataverse 表。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/guidance/reference-architectures/custom-copilot-agent-dynamics-365-power-apps","sk":["A2.13","B1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/guidance/reference-architectures/custom-copilot-agent-dynamics-365-power-apps"],"answer":"B"},"9100016":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1016,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"CAF 的四种采用模型从 Copilots 到 IaaS “you gain control and give up speed”。PaaS 的适用条件正是 “Choose it when low-code SaaS development can't give you enough customization but you still want Microsoft to run the platform for you ... you don't maintain servers or train the base models”；SaaS 的 tradeoff 是 “heavy customization reaches limits and might require a move to a managed platform”；IaaS 只在必须自带模型或自定义运行时时才选择。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy","sk":["A3.3","A2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/strategy"],"answer":"C"},"9100017":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1017,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"文档：“The effective context window is limited by the smallest underlying model. For larger contexts, use model subset to select models that support your requirements”，长请求只有恰好路由到大上下文模型时才成功。Quality 模式按质量选模型但不保证上下文；Auto-update 只是跟随新版本；部署类型与上下文长度无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router","sk":["A3.4","A3.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router"],"answer":"B"},"9100018":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1018,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"“You do not need to separately deploy the supported LLMs for use with model router, with the exception of the Claude models”；model subset 让路由只在已批准模型中进行，并作为 fallback 集合，“be sure to select model subsets with at least two models to benefit from the fallback capability”。quick deploy 会路由到全部模型，违反审批清单；routing mode 只影响成本/质量权衡。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router","sk":["A3.4","C4.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-router"],"answer":"AB"},"9100019":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1019,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"文档：“Use glossary to map your business terms to columns in your tables ... Use synonyms to add alternative names for columns in your tables”，操作路径是 Copilot Studio > Agents > Copilot in Dynamics 365 Sales > Knowledge > SalesSpecificQnA > Glossary/Synonyms，然后 Publish（需要 Copilot Studio Author 角色）。改 schema 名有破坏性且不教会 Copilot 术语；自定义 topic 工作量更大，还会产生 Copilot Studio 额度消耗；视图与术语理解无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/sales/extend-copilot-chat","sk":["B1.1","B1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/sales/extend-copilot-chat"],"answer":"A"},"9100020":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1020,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"文档要求 “Be sure to use an environment where Dynamics 365 apps are enabled ... Environments without Dynamics 365 apps, such as the default environment, aren't supported for custom connectors”，并且 “use the OAuth 2.0 authentication type, and ... Microsoft Entra ID as the authentication provider”。认证是可选的最后一步，用于让所有 Sales 用户使用；虚拟表不是 Sales agent 的扩展机制。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-sales-copilot/custom-connector-action","sk":["B1.3","B2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-sales-copilot/custom-connector-action"],"answer":"A"},"9100021":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1021,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"可扩展的能力是 email summaries、opportunity insights、opportunity summaries 和 record details，另外可在 chat 中加入新的 Q&A 能力；文档明确 “you can't add new capabilities to the non-chat features in the Sales agent”。Sales agent 开箱即连 Dynamics 365 Sales 或 Salesforce，连接器只用于补充洞察；面向所有租户的用户需要连接器和 action 通过认证。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-sales-copilot/extend-sales-app","sk":["B1.3","B3.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-sales-copilot/extend-sales-app","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-sales-copilot/custom-connector-action"],"answer":"A"},"9100022":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1022,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Copilot Studio agent design","why":"事件触发器文档：“This feature is only available for agents with generative orchestration turned on” 和 “Makers can only add event triggers to agents in environments where solution-aware cloud flow sharing is turned on”；此外管理员的 DLP 策略也可能禁止触发器。经典编排的 trigger phrase 需要用户输入，不是自主运行；频道和遥测与触发器无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-triggers-about","sk":["B1.6","B1.15"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-triggers-about","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/guidance/autonomous-agents"],"answer":"AB"},"9100023":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1023,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent types & use cases","why":"“Agents range from simple prompt-and-response agents to more advanced, fully autonomous agents”；对 Copilot Chat 用户，“Declarative agents that are grounded in instructions and public websites are available at no additional cost”，而 “Agents that access shared tenant data, such as SharePoint or Graph Connector content, are billed based on metered consumption”。自主 agent 和自定义引擎 agent 超出需求，分别带来触发器消耗和额外托管成本。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/agents","sk":["B1.7","A2.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/agents","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/agents-overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100024":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1024,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent architecture & orchestration","why":"Document Intelligence 提供 prebuilt-invoice 等预置模型 “Extract customer and vendor details”；Content Understanding 处理 documents、images、videos、audio 多模态内容，预置分析器覆盖 “call center analytics, media analysis”，可生成摘要和 KPI；Content Safety 是 “An AI service that detects unwanted contents”；Translator 可翻译 “more than 100 in-use, at-risk, and endangered languages”。Speech 只做语音转写与合成，AI Search 用于检索索引。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/what-are-ai-services","sk":["B1.8","A2.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/what-are-ai-services","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/document-intelligence/overview"],"boxes":["Document Intelligence","Content Understanding","Content Safety","Translator"]},"9100025":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1025,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Copilot Studio agent design","why":"文档把 “AI code generation tools” 列为推荐方式：“Code-first workflow. Work with TypeScript and React directly in your preferred IDE”、“Access to the latest AI models” 并且 “Available worldwide on public clouds”；浏览器内体验仅在 United States、Great Britain、Australia、Singapore 可用且目前只有 GPT-4.1。生成式页面 “currently only supported in model-driven apps”，canvas 和 Power Pages 不适用。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/model-driven-apps/generative-pages","sk":["B1.9","B1.12"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/model-driven-apps/generative-pages"],"answer":"A"},"9100026":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1026,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Copilot Studio agent design","why":"文档：“To be eligible for addition to an app, an agent must be connected to Power Apps MCP server or be in a published state”，而且自 2026 年 5 月 1 日起 agent feed 只支持通过 Power Apps MCP server 创建任务的 agent；配置 MCP server 时需改为 Maker-provided credentials 以便触发器自主初始化。agent feed 只在 model-driven apps 中可用，与 Copilot chat、app assistant agent 无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/model-driven-apps/add-agents-to-app","sk":["B1.9","B1.6"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/model-driven-apps/add-agents-to-app"],"answer":"AB"},"9100027":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1027,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Frameworks & methodologies","why":"Experience Optimization 的 workload concern 是 “Usability, relevance, composition”，原则是 “Create seamless, intuitive, and meaningful experiences”，它是 Power Platform Well-Architected 在 Azure 四大支柱之外独有的第五支柱，对话设计、fallback 与用户反馈属于此类。Reliability 关注韧性与恢复，Performance Efficiency 关注伸缩，Operational Excellence 关注可观测性与安全部署。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/well-architected/pillars","sk":["B1.13","B1.10"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/well-architected/pillars","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/guidance/architecture-overview"],"answer":"C"},"9100028":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1028,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Copilot Studio agent design","why":"文档：“Prompts created in Tools can be used in any agent or topic”，而在 topic 内（或 Power Apps/Power Automate 中）创建的 prompt 不会出现在 Tools 页供其他 agent 复用。导入 agent 不会共享 prompt 工具；编排模式与 prompt 可见性无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/create-custom-prompt","sk":["B1.16","B1.15"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/create-custom-prompt","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/nlu-prompt-node"],"answer":"A"},"9100029":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1029,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Governance, security & compliance","why":"训练类型表：Standard “Training occurs in the current Foundry resource's region and provides guarantees for data residency”；Global 更便宜但 “Data and weights are copied to the region where training occurs”；Developer “There are no guarantees for data residency either”；Data zone 目前 “Only the US data zone is currently supported”，对瑞典不适用。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","sk":["B2.1","C4.6"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100030":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1030,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Microsoft 365 Copilot extensibility","why":"SharePoint agents 由 site owner/editor 无代码创建，面向 “specify specific sites, document libraries, and files for Copilot to search”，并 “discoverable directly in Microsoft Teams chats and in the Teams Store under the Agents category”。文档也指出其限制：不能发布到组织目录，在 Copilot Chat 中无法与 SharePoint 之外构建的 declarative agent 集成。自定义引擎 agent 和 Copilot Studio 发布都超出“无代码、不发布目录”的要求；Copilot connector 用于索引外部数据而非创建 agent。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/declarative-agent-tool-comparison","sk":["B2.7","B2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/extensibility/declarative-agent-tool-comparison","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/agent-essentials/m365-agents-admin-guide"],"answer":"A"},"9100031":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1031,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Agent types & use cases","why":"Researcher “handle complex, multi-step research tasks. It delivers comprehensive, source-cited reports” 并 “draws insights from both the web and your work content - including files, emails, meetings, and chats”；Employee Self-Service agent 基于 Copilot Studio 构建、可定制，支持 “querying HR policies, initiating IT support tickets” 并自带 ServiceNow、Workday、SAP SuccessFactors 加速器；Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot “enables sellers to efficiently search, synthesize, and take action on sales data from various Microsoft 365 applications”。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/researcher-agent","sk":["B3.3","B2.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/researcher-agent","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/employee-self-service/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/sales/ai-agent-overview"],"boxes":["Researcher","Employee Self-Service agent","Sales agent in Microsoft 365 Copilot"]},"9100032":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1032,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Dynamics 365 Copilot features","why":"教程：F&O virtual entities “expose live operational data in Microsoft Dataverse”，“When you connect the virtual entities as knowledge sources in Microsoft Copilot Studio, your agent can interact in natural language with the data available in finance and operations apps”，示例正是 mserp_inventoryonhandaientity。Excel 导出不是实时数据；公共网站和 AI general knowledge 不包含企业库存。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/tutorial-agent-knowledge","sk":["B3.6","B3.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/tutorial-agent-knowledge","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/extend-copilot-generative-help"],"answer":"A"},"9100033":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1033,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Monitoring & analytics","why":"文档：“To view comments, you must have the Bot Transcript Viewer security role”，反馈数据存放在 Dataverse 的 conversation transcript 表；Analytics Viewer 只能看 Monitor 页聚合数据，分享文档也写明看 transcript 需要额外的 Bot Transcript Viewer 角色。两个管理员角色都远超所需权限。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-improve-agent-effectiveness","sk":["C1.2","C1.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-improve-agent-effectiveness","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100034":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1034,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Monitoring & analytics","why":"对比表：environment-level telemetry “Configured once for the environment”，由管理员/平台团队/CoE 拥有，采用 “Trace or span-based telemetry aligned with OpenTelemetry concepts”，适合 “Agent invocations, tool execution, outputs, dependencies, and cross-agent monitoring”（dependencies 表）；agent-level telemetry 需逐个 agent 配置，是事件型（customEvents）且 “doesn't include any OpenTelemetry-aligned spans”。transcripts 和 Monitor Summary 都不是跨 agent 的技术遥测。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/telemetry-overview","sk":["C1.5","C1.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/telemetry-overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100035":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1035,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing & quality","why":"生成选项的说明：“Knowledge sources: ... Knowledge works best for agents that use generative orchestration” 与 “Topics: ... Topics works best for agents that use classic orchestration”。test chat 选项只是复用最近一次测试对话中已问过的问题，不是自动生成。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create","sk":["C2.5","C2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-intro"],"answer":"B"},"9100036":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1036,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing & quality","why":"“Quick question set ... based on your agent's description, instructions, and capabilities. This option generates 10 questions”；Themes 是把真实用户提问聚类后的分组，在 Monitor 页对某主题选 Evaluate 即可生成针对该领域（如 billing and payments）的测试集；CSV/TXT 导入支持最多 100 题、每题 1,000 字符并带 Expected response 列。Full question set 从知识源或 topic 生成，不对应这三项。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create","sk":["C2.5","C2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/analytics-agent-evaluation-create"],"boxes":["Quick question set","Create a test set from a theme","Import a CSV file"]},"9100037":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1037,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"ALM & deployment","why":"文档：“For the Environment, set the Fill using value to Custom value. You can select a specific environment or select the (Current) environment if you deploy the agent solution in other environments”，并要求 Custom API 对象 “Create the object in your Power Apps solution that you deploy with your agent or extension”。agent deployment wizard 只用于部署 Microsoft 提供的 Dynamics 365 agents；手工重建或改非托管解决方案都不是可重复的 ALM。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/copilot-ai-plugins","sk":["C3.5","C3.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/copilot-ai-plugins","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/fin-ops-core/dev-itpro/copilot/agent-deployment"],"answer":"A"},"9100038":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1038,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Governance, security & compliance","why":"CAF：“Use Microsoft Entra ID instead of API keys when the Azure service supports it”，“Give AI agents their own governed identities ... Use Microsoft Entra Agent ID” 并 “Restrict agent tools and permissions ... grant least-privilege permissions”。密钥写入 prompt 正是文档要避免的 “storing credentials in prompts or code”；默认 guardrail 关闭需要额外审批，且文档建议 “Use trusted model sources ... Apply additional scrutiny to models from external or community sources”。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/platform/security","sk":["C4.3","C4.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai/platform/security","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/guardrails/guardrails-overview"],"answer":"AB"},"9100039":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1039,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Governance, security & compliance","why":"Prompt Shields 的 document attacks 针对 “hidden instructions in third-party content, such as documents, emails, and web pages, that attempt to take control of the model session”，在 Foundry 中 “the system scans for these attacks at the user input and tool response intervention points”；agents 支持 Annotate and block，且 agent 的风险检测以分配给它的 guardrail 为准（覆盖模型的 guardrail）。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection","sk":["C4.4","C4.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/guardrails/guardrails-overview"],"answer":"A"},"9100040":{"exam":"AB-100","n":1040,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Governance, security & compliance","why":"四类 harm 控件检测的是有害内容类别，不识别文档中的隐藏指令（indirect/document attack）；而且只配置在 output intervention point，无法在 agent 执行工具调用前拦截。需要的是 Prompt Shields 的 indirect attack 控件，并覆盖 user input 与 tool response 两个介入点。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/guardrails/guardrails-overview","sk":["C4.4","C4.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/guardrails/guardrails-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/jailbreak-detection"],"answer":"B"},"9620101":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1101,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Security, authentication & governance","why":"文档明确 Teams + Microsoft 365 渠道只支持 Authenticate with Microsoft，选其它选项该渠道就会 blocked——这正是 Adjuster Desk 当前用 Generic OAuth 2 导致的问题；Authenticate with Microsoft 下用户始终已登录，可以用 agent sharing 控制组织内谁能聊，所以把 agent 共享给 Claims Adjusters 安全组即满足\"只有调解员能聊\"。No authentication 让任何拿到链接的人都能聊且违反 Tailspin-Internal 的合规要求；Generic OAuth 2 即使开了 Require users to sign in 也无法用 sharing 限定具体用户，且渠道仍被阻止；共享给 Everyone 违反\"仅安全组成员\"。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","sk":["A1.7","A1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/admin-share-bots"],"answer":"B"},"9620102":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1102,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Channels & publishing","why":"Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot 渠道加上 Make agent available in Microsoft Copilot 让 agent 同时出现在 Teams 和 Microsoft 365 Copilot（可 @ 调用）；嵌入自己网站页面用 Custom website 渠道的代码片段；原生/自定义应用走 Mobile app 渠道，从 Token Endpoint 取 Direct Line token 后用 Direct Line API 对话；Demo website 是发布后自动生成的预置测试站，文档明确\"不用于生产、不要把 URL 分享给客户\"。SharePoint 渠道与任何需求无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-fundamentals-publish-channels","sk":["A1.3","A1.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-fundamentals-publish-channels","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-connect-bot-to-custom-application","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-connect-bot-to-web-channels"],"boxes":["Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot","Custom website","Mobile app","Demo website"]},"9620103":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1103,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Security, authentication & governance","why":"案例要求两条限制必须由管理员在 Power Platform admin center 集中强制，所以都用 data policy：阻止 \"Chat without Microsoft Entra ID authentication in Copilot Studio\" 连接器后 maker 只能选 Authenticate with Microsoft 或 Authenticate manually；阻止 \"Direct Line channels in Copilot Studio\" 连接器同时覆盖 Demo website、Custom website、Mobile app 等所有 Direct Line 渠道（SharePoint 连接器只管 SharePoint 渠道，口头要求 maker 不算集中强制）。Purview 文档给出 eDiscovery 用 ItemClass = IPM.SkypeTeams.Message.Copilot.Studio.* 检索 Copilot Studio 交互并导出；Application Insights 和 Bot Transcript Viewer 都不是 Purview。转录访问由环境级安全角色决定——Bot Transcript Viewer 能看该环境所有 agent 的转录，文档建议\"为 agent 创建单独环境\"来控制谁能看，这正是 Tailspin-Customer 单独环境的用途。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/admin-data-loss-prevention","sk":["A1.5","A1.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/admin-data-loss-prevention","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/purview/ai-copilot-studio","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/admin-share-bots"],"boxes":["Block the Chat without Microsoft Entra ID authentication in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal","Block the Direct Line channels in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy scoped to Tailspin-Internal","Create an eDiscovery case and search for items whose ItemClass is IPM.SkypeTeams.Message.Copilot.Studio.*","Keep Policy Assistant in the separate Tailspin-Customer environment and assign the Bot Transcript Viewer security role there only to the privacy team"]},"9620104":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1104,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"交互式卡片（用户要提交数据）必须用 Ask with Adaptive Card 节点，至少含一个 submit 按钮，Copilot Studio 会根据卡片里的 input 自动创建输出变量，所以提交的 loss date 之后在主题里可用；Message 节点上的卡片只用于展示，不能收集输入。要把已有变量放进卡片，需在节点属性里切到 Formula，JSON 会被转换成 Power Fx 公式后直接引用 Topic.PolicyNumber——JSON 字面量里写 {Topic.PolicyNumber} 只是字符串。Teams 只支持 1.5 版 schema，Web Chat 不支持 Action.Execute，E 反而让卡片在两个渠道都无法正常渲染。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","sk":["A3.8","A3.9"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/adaptive-cards-overview"],"answer":"AC"},"9620105":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1105,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"Message 节点加 message variations 后每次触发随机选一条，不需要新主题；Message 节点工具栏提供 Markdown 式基本格式（bold、bullet、numbered），渠道对照表里 Website 对 Markdown 是 Supported，案例也禁止 HTML/自定义代码；标准（未自定义）的 generative answers 回答会自动附带 citations 指向来源文档，手工贴链接或 basic card 不是来源引用。Authenticate with Microsoft 下 User.DisplayName 可用、User.AccessToken 不可用，而且文档警告不要把 AccessToken 放进 Message 节点；再问一次名字违反\"不询问\"要求。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-send-message","sk":["A3.2","A3.9"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-send-message","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-fundamentals-publish-channels","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-end-user-authentication"],"boxes":["Add message variations to the greeting Message node","Use Markdown formatting in the Message node","Answer from the SharePoint knowledge source with a standard generative answers node so that citations are included","Insert the User.DisplayName variable into the greeting Message node"]},"9620106":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1106,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing, evaluation & analytics","why":"Fabric data agent 以 connected agent 形式从 Agents 页 Add an agent → Microsoft Fabric 接入，连接后可在 additional details 里选 User authentication（按每个用户在 Fabric 的权限查询）或 Agent author authentication（人人看到作者能看的数据，违反\"限于各自权限\"），语义模型不能作为知识源；Fabric 文档明确\"带 connected Fabric data agent 的自定义 agent 目前不支持 Microsoft 365 Copilot，仅在 Teams 验证过\"，而 Redirect 节点不能指向 agent、classic orchestration 根本不会调用连接的 agent。Application Insights 在 Settings > Advanced 填 Connection string 并打开 Enable logging 即记录进出消息和事件，Log sensitive Activity properties 违反合规要求，阻止连接器则完全无法发遥测。所有事件都在 customEvents 表且带 designMode 自定义维度，用 where 排除测试面板再按 channelId 分组 dcount(user_Id)；Copilot Studio Dashboard workbook 直接提供总会话、延迟、异常、工具使用等视图，Copilot Studio 自带 Analytics 页不在 Azure 里。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/add-agent-fabric-data-agent","sk":["B4.3","B3.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/add-agent-fabric-data-agent","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-science/data-agent-microsoft-copilot-studio","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-bot-framework-composer-capture-telemetry"],"boxes":["On the Agents page add the Claims Metrics Fabric data agent as a connected agent and set its authentication to User authentication","Have adjusters ask metric questions in Teams, because a connected Fabric data agent is not supported in Microsoft 365 Copilot","In Settings > Advanced > Application Insights, enter the connection string and turn on Enable logging","customEvents | where customDimensions['designMode'] == 'False' | summarize dcount(user_Id) by bin(timestamp, 1d), tostring(customDimensions['channelId'])","Open the Copilot Studio Dashboard workbook under Monitoring > Workbooks in the Application Insights resource"]},"9620001":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1001,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Security, authentication & governance","why":"Authenticate manually 是唯一既支持 Teams 以外渠道、又提供 User.AccessToken 的选项；关闭 Require users to sign in 后，agent 只在遇到需要认证的主题（Authenticate 节点）时才要求登录，一般问题可匿名回答。A 错：Authenticate with Microsoft 只支持 Teams + Microsoft 365 渠道，其他渠道会被阻止，且不提供 User.AccessToken。C 错：No authentication 下 agent 只能访问公开信息，无法代表用户调用 API。D 错：打开 Require users to sign in 会在对话一开始就强制所有人登录，违背匿名提问的需求。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","sk":["A1.7","A1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-end-user-authentication"],"answer":"B"},"9620002":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1002,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Security, authentication & governance","why":"Authenticate with Microsoft 自动为 Teams/Microsoft 365 配置 Entra ID 登录、无需任何手动配置，但只在这些渠道工作；No authentication 让任何拿到链接的人都能聊天、只能访问公开信息；在自定义网站上要用 agent sharing 控制\"谁能聊\"，必须选 Authenticate manually + Microsoft Entra ID 并打开 Require users to sign in（文档明确 Generic OAuth 2 无法通过 sharing 控制具体用户）；外部客户用消费者 OAuth2 IdP 且需要 User.AccessToken，只能选 Authenticate manually + Generic OAuth 2，打开 Require users to sign in 后登录的用户才能聊天。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","sk":["A1.7","A1.2","A1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-fundamentals-publish-channels"],"boxes":["Authenticate with Microsoft","No authentication","Authenticate manually with Microsoft Entra ID and Require users to sign in turned on","Authenticate manually with Generic OAuth 2 and Require users to sign in turned on"]},"9620003":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1003,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"Speech override 让同一个 Message 节点在语音渠道上念出与文本显示不同的内容，SSML 的 break 标签插入停顿、prosody 标签调整语速，网页上的文本不受影响。A 错：message variation 只是每次随机挑一条文本来发送，既不能控制语速和停顿，还会改变网页显示。C 错：barge-in 只是允许用户打断 agent 播报。D 错：Utterance end timeout 是判断用户是否说完话的等待时间，与 agent 的播报方式无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-send-message","sk":["A3.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-send-message","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/voice-configuration"],"answer":"B"},"9620004":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1004,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Prompts & generative answers","why":"这是文档 \"Customize the agent's response\" 的流程：清掉 Send a message 并把答案存进变量后，节点不再直接回复，再在 Message 节点的 Adaptive Card 里切到 Formula 用 Power Fx 引用该变量渲染。B 只控制节点搜索哪些知识源；D 错：Ask with Adaptive Card 节点是交互卡片、必须含提交按钮，只展示信息要用 Message 节点；E 只是放宽内容审核。注意：在 Teams 里自定义后的答案不会自动带 citation，需要把 Save LLM response 设为 Complete 并用 SendActivity 的 citationEntities 显式渲染。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/nlu-boost-node","sk":["A3.2","A3.7","A3.8"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/nlu-boost-node","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/publication-add-bot-to-microsoft-teams"],"answer":"AC"},"9620005":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1005,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"文档规定：卡片要包含动态信息必须在节点属性里切到 Formula，切换会把 JSON 自动转成 Power Fx 公式，然后用 Topic.CustomerName 等变量替换硬编码文本；切换是单向的，建议先备份 JSON。A 错：payload editor 只接受 JSON 字面量，不会解析变量名。C 错：Edit Schema 用于修正由卡片 inputs 生成的输出变量列表，不是绑定显示值。D 错：Message 节点里的卡片不可交互，无法收集提交的地址。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","sk":["A3.8","A3.9"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-send-message"],"answer":"B"},"9620006":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1006,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"Ask with Adaptive Card 节点会按卡片的 inputs 自动生成输出变量，用户提交时填值（Message 节点里的卡片只用于展示，不收集输入）；文档建议在每个 Action.Submit 的 data 里放唯一标识（如 actionSubmitId）并在处理时校验，以区分连续卡片的提交。D 只控制用户打字而非提交时重发卡片的次数；E 错：Teams 只支持到 schema 1.5，Web Chat 不支持 Action.Execute。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","sk":["A3.8"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-with-adaptive-card","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/adaptive-cards-overview"],"answer":"AB"},"9620007":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1007,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"文档的 Greeting / Talk to Customer 示例正是这个场景：目标主题的变量勾选 Receive values from other topics，源主题的 Redirect 节点用 Add input 传值，目标主题就跳过提问；直接触发时仍会问。A 能工作但违反\"最少全局变量\"，文档也指出主题间传值可减少对 global variable 的需求。C 错：主题变量默认只能在创建它的主题里使用，另一个主题无法直接引用。D 错：Ask every time 会强制每次都问。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables","sk":["A3.9"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables-bot","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-ask-a-question"],"answer":"B"},"9620008":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1008,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Topics & conversation design","why":"这是文档 \"Set global variables from external sources\" 的做法：变量设为 Global 并勾选 External sources can set values，网页用查询字符串（或自定义画布的 pvaSetContext 事件）传入；查询参数名必须不带 Global. 前缀，所以 C 错。A 错：No authentication 下 User.DisplayName 等认证变量不可用。D 错：环境变量在 Copilot Studio 中只读、由管理员在 Power Apps 设置，不是逐个用户的运行时上下文。建议同时为变量配置 timeout 和默认值，避免等待外部值造成延迟。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables-bot","sk":["A3.9","A1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables-bot","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-end-user-authentication","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-variables-about"],"answer":"B"},"9620009":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1009,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Multi-agent & MCP","why":"前提是 Fabric data agent 已发布且带详细描述（否则在 Copilot Studio 的列表里看不到）；然后在主 agent 的 Agents 页 Add an agent → Microsoft Fabric，选择或创建到 Fabric 的连接，再从有权限的 data agent 列表中选择并调整描述（描述决定生成式编排器何时调用它），最后在测试面板验证委派后发布。语义模型不是以知识源方式接入；文档明确 Fabric data agent 目前不支持用 Redirect 节点重定向。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/add-agent-fabric-data-agent","sk":["B3.4","B3.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/add-agent-fabric-data-agent","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-science/data-agent-microsoft-copilot-studio","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/authoring-add-other-agents"],"boxes":["In Microsoft Fabric, publish the data agent with a detailed description.","On the Copilot Studio agent's Agents page, select Add an agent and choose Microsoft Fabric under Connect to an external agent.","Select an existing connection to Microsoft Fabric or create a new one.","Select the Fabric data agent from the list and refine its description so the orchestrator knows when to invoke it.","Test in the test pane that metric questions are delegated to the connected agent, then publish the Copilot Studio agent."]},"9620010":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1010,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Multi-agent & MCP","why":"连接的 Fabric data agent 可在 additional details 里选 User authentication 或 Agent author authentication；作者身份（maker 凭据）让所有人看到作者可见的数据，用户身份则按每个用户自己在 Fabric 的权限（含 RLS）查询，文档同时要求用户对 data agent 及其底层数据源至少有读权限。A 错：仍以作者身份查询，无法区分用户。C 错：Teams + Microsoft 365 渠道只支持 Authenticate with Microsoft，改手动认证会阻止 Teams 渠道，且与连接 agent 的身份选择无关。D 不是文档中集成 Fabric data agent 的方式，也不满足\"最少改动\"。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-science/data-agent-microsoft-copilot-studio","sk":["B3.4","A1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-science/data-agent-microsoft-copilot-studio","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/add-tools-custom-agent","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/configuration-end-user-authentication"],"answer":"B"},"9620011":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1011,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing, evaluation & analytics","why":"所有 agent-level 事件都带 designMode 自定义维度（True/False），用 where 子句即可排除测试面板会话；Node execution events 选项会在主题中每个节点执行时记录事件（Enable logging 只记录进出的消息和事件）；匿名网站会话每次生成随机 user ID，只有用户经过认证、ID 跨会话一致时 dcount(user_Id) 才准确；要禁止 maker 启用 agent-level 遥测，需在 Power Platform 管理中心的数据策略里阻止 \"Application Insights in Copilot Studio\" 连接器，逐个删连接字符串无法阻止再次添加。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-bot-framework-composer-capture-telemetry","sk":["B4.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-bot-framework-composer-capture-telemetry"],"boxes":["Filter on the designMode custom dimension","Node execution events","Require users to sign in so that user IDs are consistent across conversations","Block the Application Insights in Copilot Studio connector in a data policy that applies to the environment"]},"9620012":{"exam":"AB-620","n":1012,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Testing, evaluation & analytics","why":"Environment-level telemetry 在 Power Platform 管理中心（Manage > Data export > App Insights，导出类型 Copilot Studio）为整个托管环境配置一次、由管理员拥有，把 InvokeAgent / ExecuteTool / OutputMessages 以 OpenTelemetry 对齐的 span 写入 dependencies 表，适合跨 agent 监控。A 是 agent-level：每个 agent 单独配置、事件型（customEvents）、不含 OpenTelemetry span。C 的 workbook 只是基于 agent-level 数据的可视化，不采集数据。D 的 Sentinel 面向 maker 审计日志，不是对话遥测。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/telemetry-overview","sk":["B4.3","A1.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/telemetry-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/advanced-environment-level-agent-telemetry","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/security-and-governance"],"answer":"B"},"9103101":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1101,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"技术需求要求\"整图单句英文描述、不含性别词、一次 Foundry Tools 调用且不需要模型部署\"，这正是 Image Analysis 4.0 的 Caption 特性加 `gender-neutral-caption=true`（默认会出现 man/woman/boy/girl，设为 true 后替换为 person）；Learn 的 alt text 用例页也明确推荐用 4.0 caption 作为 alt text，并指出 gender-neutral 能消除\"把成年女性标成 girl\"这类错误（对应 Issues）。A 错：denseCaptions 返回整图加最多 10 个区域各一句并带 boundingBox，是区域描述而非单句 alt text；C 错：tags 只是标签列表，不是完整句子；D 错：gpt-4.1 是模型部署，违反\"不需要模型部署\"。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/use-case-alt-text","sk":["C2.4","C2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/use-case-alt-text","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40"],"answer":"B"},"9103102":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1102,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Planning & managing Azure AI solutions","why":"索引器一次运行只要失败文档数低于 Max failed items 就显示 Success，Get Indexer Status 返回最近 50 次运行的 executionHistory，每次运行带 errors、warnings、itemsProcessed、itemsFailed，能定位未索引的 PDF 及原因（Issues 里\"Success 但文档缺失\"正是这种情况）；Skill execution invocation count 指标带 Failed、SkillName、SkillType 等维度，Learn 明确建议\"Set up to alert on failed skill invocations\"；Search Latency 是平均查询延迟，Learn 推荐的 Azure AI Search 警报规则就是\"average search latency greater than a user-specified threshold\"。活动日志只有 Get Admin Key 之类控制面事件、不含请求内容；Throttled search queries percentage 衡量被丢弃的查询而非延迟；search1 没有配置诊断设置，AzureDiagnostics 里没有任何 Query.Search 记录。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-monitor-indexers","sk":["A3.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-monitor-indexers","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search-data-reference","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search"],"boxes":["The errors and warnings in the execution history returned by Get Indexer Status","A metric alert on Skill execution invocation count, split by the Failed and SkillName dimensions","A metric alert on Search Latency"]},"9103103":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1103,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"禁止符号是图片样本、每周更新、几小时内生效且不训练模型，只有 Custom categories (rapid) 的 image incident 满足：建 incident、上传样本图、deploy 后无需训练即可检测，而且\"可以把 incident 放进常规的 image analysis 请求里，同一次调用仍能做其他审核\"，正好同时满足\"同一次审核检查 sexual/violent/hate/self-harm\"的要求；gpt-image-1 生成的每张图都自动附带基于 C2PA 的 Content Credentials 清单（softwareAgent 为 Azure OpenAI ImageGen），\"No additional setup is necessary\"，读者可用 contentcredentials.org/verify 验证。B 错：standard 只支持文本、训练需数小时，而且将于 2026-09-01 退役；C 错：blocklist 只做精确文本匹配、不支持图片；E 错：brand detection 只存在于 Image Analysis 3.2，且识别的是全球知名商标库，不是 Litware 自定义的符号。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/custom-categories","sk":["C3.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/concepts/custom-categories","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/how-to/custom-categories-rapid","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry-classic/openai/concepts/content-credentials"],"answer":"AD"},"9103104":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1104,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"AIProjectClient 接的是 Foundry 项目端点，格式为 `https://<resource-name>.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/<project-name>`，配 DefaultAzureCredential 即用 cms1 的托管身份、不用 API key；`get_openai_client()` 返回面向项目端点 Responses API 的 OpenAI 兼容客户端，可直接调用 Foundry Models。Responses API 的图片输入项类型是 `input_image`，`image_url` 直接是 URL 字符串，一次请求可放多张图（八张远低于上限）；要准确读出球衣号码和标牌小字，`detail` 必须用 `high`（high-res 模式按 512×512 分块处理），Learn 明确 low 分辨率\"could impact the accuracy of object and text recognition\"。`/openai/v1/` 是 Azure OpenAI 资源端点而非项目端点；`image_url` 是 Chat Completions 的内容类型，不是 Responses API 的；`input_file` 用于文档文件。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/how-to/develop/sdk-overview","sk":["C2.3","B1.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/how-to/develop/sdk-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/responses","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision"],"boxes":["https://foundry1.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/Project1","input_image","high"]},"9103105":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1105,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Information extraction solutions","why":"Content Understanding 的 prebuilt-videoSearch 输出 RAG-ready 的 Markdown：按段落给出结合视觉与语音上下文的描述、WEBVTT 转录和关键帧，\"can drop straight into a vector store… no post-processing is required\"；prebuilt-callCenter 是音频分析器，做 agent/customer 角色识别与情感，不处理视频。Azure Content Understanding skill 对比 Document Extraction skill：支持跨页表格作为单元提取、语义分块，并在配置 modelName/modelDeployment 后为内嵌图表生成描述内联进 Markdown chunk，Document Extraction skill 两者都不支持；GenAI Prompt skill 虽能 verbalize 图片，但不做表格提取，且\"doesn't support image-to-vector queries\"。以图搜图必须用多模态嵌入模型及其 vectorizer，即 Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill。Azure AI Search tool 让 agent 通过项目连接查询现有索引并返回引文，query_type 支持 vector_semantic_hybrid；File Search 需要把文件上传到向量存储，不能使用现有的 archive-index。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/video/overview","sk":["E1.1","E1.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/video/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/multimodal-search-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/agents/how-to/tools/ai-search"],"boxes":["The prebuilt-videoSearch analyzer in Azure Content Understanding","The Azure Content Understanding skill","The Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill","The Azure AI Search tool"]},"9103106":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1106,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"需求是\"单次 chat completions 请求直接接收 WAV、没有单独的 speech-to-text 步骤\"并要判断来电者的语气，只有音频模型能做到：gpt-4o-audio-preview（或 gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview）在 /chat/completions 上支持 audio → text 这一模态组合，消息 content 用 `{\"type\":\"input_audio\",\"input_audio\":{\"data\":<base64>,\"format\":\"wav\"}}` 加文本提问即可，音频文件上限 20 MB、Litware 的 voicemail 都小于 10 MB。B、C 都先转写再提问，既是独立的 speech-to-text 步骤，又丢掉了语气等文字里没有的信息；D 错：gpt-4.1 不是音频模型，image_url 只接受图片。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart","sk":["D2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision"],"answer":"A"},"9103001":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1001,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Planning & managing Azure AI solutions","why":"Indexer 的一次运行即使有个别文档出错，只要错误数低于 Max failed items 仍显示 Success；Get Indexer Status 返回最近 50 次运行的 executionHistory，其中每次运行的 errors、warnings、itemsProcessed、itemsFailed 能定位失败文档及原因。Activity log 只记录 Get Admin Key 等控制平面事件，Search Latency 是查询性能指标，Application Insights 事件只反映客户端查询行为，都不能解释摄取缺失。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-howto-monitor-indexers","sk":["A3.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-howto-monitor-indexers","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search"],"answer":"A"},"9103002":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1002,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Planning & managing Azure AI solutions","why":"查询层面的信息只存在于资源日志：启用诊断设置把 OperationLogs 送到 Log Analytics 后，AzureDiagnostics 里的 Query.Search 记录带有 Query_s（查询参数）和 Documents_d（返回文档数），可筛出零结果查询；被丢弃的查询由平台指标 ThrottledSearchQueriesPercentage 度量，官方推荐对它建 metric alert。Activity log 只有控制平面的 Get Admin Key，Indexer 状态与 debug session 关注的是摄取而不是查询。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search-data-reference","sk":["A3.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search-data-reference","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-performance-analysis","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/monitor-azure-cognitive-search"],"answer":"AB"},"9103003":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1003,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Dense Captions 会为整幅图像以及最多 10 个区域各生成一句描述，并返回每个区域的 boundingBox，一次 Analyze 调用即可满足两项要求；Caption 只返回整图一句话，Objects 只返回对象名称和框而没有句子描述，Tags 只是标签列表。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40","sk":["C2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/how-to/call-analyze-image-40"],"answer":"B"},"9103004":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1004,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Image Analysis 4.0 的 Caption 与 Dense Captions 只生成英文的一句话描述，无法输出日语长文，也不会把多张图像合在一起理解；Read 只做 OCR。Vision-enabled chat model（o-series、GPT-5、GPT-4.1、GPT-4o 等）接受 message content 数组中最多 10 个 image_url，可按 prompt 要求用任意语言生成详细的多段描述。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision","sk":["C2.2","C2.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40"],"answer":"C"},"9103005":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1005,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"detail 有 low、high、auto 三个值：low 只处理 512x512 的低分辨率版本，文档明确指出会影响对象与文本识别的准确度；high 先看低分辨率图再按 512x512 分块以双倍 token 细读，适合读取标签上的小字。省略 detail 等于 auto，由模型按图像大小自行决定，不能保证高分辨率；图像必须放在 type 为 image_url 的 content part 中。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision","sk":["C2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision"],"answer":"B"},"9103006":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1006,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Chat Completions 的图像 content part 类型是 image_url，其 url 既可以是公开的 HTTPS 地址，也可以是 data:{mime_type};base64,{data} 形式的 data URI；要让模型细读小字必须把 detail 设为 high，low 只用 512x512 版本，auto 由模型自行决定。input_image 是 Realtime API 的 conversation item 类型，不属于 Chat Completions。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision","sk":["C2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision"],"boxes":["\"image_url\"","f\"data:image/jpeg;base64,{encoded}\"","\"high\""]},"9103007":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1007,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Transparency note 把 \"assist people who are blind and people with low vision by describing image content in human-readable language\" 列为 Image Analysis 的预期用途，并说明为此提供了 gender-neutral 参数：Caption 返回一句话描述，gender-neutral-caption=true 把 man/woman 换成 person、boy/girl 换成 child。Dense Captions 产生最多 10 句区域描述并不是简短 alt text，Read 只是 OCR，而文档明确指出 Customization 不适合生成用于无障碍 alt text 的描述。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40","sk":["C2.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/responsible-ai/computer-vision/image-analysis-transparency-note"],"answer":"A"},"9103008":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1008,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Caption 用一句话描述整幅图像，适合简短 alt text；Dense Captions 为最多 10 个区域各生成一句描述并带 boundingBox，适合分区的扩展描述；Read 是 Image Analysis 4.0 的同步 OCR，返回图中文字；Image Analysis 的描述只支持英文且只有一句话，所以德语的多段长描述需要 vision-enabled chat model 按 prompt 生成。smartCrops 只返回裁剪区域坐标，与描述无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/overview-image-analysis","sk":["C2.4","C2.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/overview-image-analysis","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/computer-vision/concept-describe-images-40","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/gpt-with-vision"],"boxes":["Image Analysis 4.0 caption","Image Analysis 4.0 denseCaptions","Image Analysis 4.0 read","A vision-enabled chat model such as GPT-4o"]},"9103009":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1009,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"gpt-4o-audio-preview 和 gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview 支持在 Chat Completions 中以 input_audio（base64 data 加 format）作为输入、输出文本或文本加音频，文档列出的 Audio → Text 组合正是异步的音频理解场景，且音频文件上限 20 MB。Realtime API 面向低延迟\"speech in, speech out\"的实时会话，gpt-4o-mini-tts 只做文本转语音，image_url 是图像输入的 content 类型。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart","sk":["D2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/realtime-audio"],"answer":"A"},"9103010":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1010,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"Chat Completions 的音频输入输出由 gpt-4o-audio-preview / gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview 提供，gpt-4o-mini-tts 只做语音合成，realtime 模型走 Realtime API；录音放在 type 为 input_audio 的 content part（含 base64 data 与 format）；响应里 message.audio.data 是 base64 音频，message.audio.id 用于多轮引用，message.audio.transcript 才是语音回答的文字。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart","sk":["D2.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/audio-completions-quickstart"],"boxes":["gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview","input_audio","choices[0].message.audio.transcript"]},"9103011":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1011,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Generative AI & agentic solutions","why":"文档说明 Responses API 只对 Azure OpenAI 模型和支持它的 Foundry Models sold by Azure 可用，不支持的部署会返回 400 Model not supported，此时应改用 Chat Completions API（client.chat.completions.create），同一客户端、同一部署名即可。/openai/v1/ 路由采用隐式版本，不需要 api-version；部署类型不改变 API 支持范围；/anthropic 端点只服务 Claude 模型。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/foundry-models/concepts/endpoints","sk":["B1.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/foundry-models/concepts/endpoints"],"answer":"B"},"9103012":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1012,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Generative AI & agentic solutions","why":"Azure AI Search tool 支持 simple、vector、semantic、vector_simple_hybrid、vector_semantic_hybrid 五种 query_type，只有 vector_semantic_hybrid 同时结合关键字、向量和语义重排；vector 只做向量检索。文档要求索引包含一个可检索（retrievable）的来源 URL 字段（可选标题字段），citations 才能带链接。top_k 默认 5，设为 1 只会减少召回；访问索引的是项目的托管身份，不需要给终端用户授 Search Index Data Reader。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/agents/how-to/tools/ai-search","sk":["B1.2","E1.5"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/agents/how-to/tools/ai-search"],"answer":"AC"},"9103013":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1013,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Generative AI & agentic solutions","why":"SDK 概览明确指出项目端点目前不路由 embedding 请求，生成 embeddings 要用 OpenAI SDK 直连 /openai/v1 端点，并可用 DefaultAzureCredential 的 bearer token provider 保持 keyless。/anthropic 端点只服务 Claude 模型的 Messages API，Foundry Tools 端点服务 Vision、Speech 等预构建工具，都不提供文本 embeddings。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/how-to/develop/sdk-overview","sk":["B1.5","B1.6"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/how-to/develop/sdk-overview"],"answer":"B"},"9103014":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1014,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Generative AI & agentic solutions","why":"Model router 的有效上下文窗口受最小底层模型限制，长 prompt 只有恰好被路由到大窗口模型时才成功，文档的 troubleshooting 建议是缩短 prompt 或用 model subset 只选择支持更大上下文的模型。Routing mode 只在质量与成本间取舍，自动升级会改变模型集合但不保证窗口，部署类型只影响数据处理边界。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/model-router","sk":["B3.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/model-router"],"answer":"B"},"9103015":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1015,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Sora 2 API 的 seconds 只接受 4、8、12（默认 4），size 只有竖版 720x1280（默认）和横版 1280x720；input_reference 是作为第一帧视觉锚点的单张参考图（jpeg/png/webp，尺寸须与 size 完全一致），remix_video_id 则引用已完成的视频以复用其结构与运动，prompt 只是文字描述。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/video-generation","sk":["C1.2"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/video-generation"],"boxes":["12","1280x720","input_reference"]},"9103016":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1016,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Sora 2 的 remix 功能用 remix_video_id 引用一个已完成的视频，在保留其结构、运动和取景的前提下做针对性修改，而不是从头重新生成；重新提交 prompt 会生成完全不同的视频，input_reference 只接受单张图像作为第一帧锚点，gpt-image-1 的 edits 只能编辑静态图片。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/video-generation","sk":["C1.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/video-generation"],"answer":"B"},"9103017":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1017,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"background=transparent 生成透明背景，且要求 output_format 为 PNG；output_compression（0–100）只作用于 JPEG 输出以缩小文件；input_fidelity 控制模型保留输入图像（尤其是面部）特征的程度，gpt-image-1-mini 不支持；stream=true 配合 partial_images（0–3）返回中间图像。quality 只调 low/medium/high 画质，n 是每次请求生成的图像数（1–10）。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/dall-e","sk":["C1.5","C1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/dall-e"],"boxes":["background","output_compression","input_fidelity","partial_images"]},"9103018":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1018,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Content Understanding 通过自定义 analyzer 提取结构化字段：以 prebuilt-image 为 baseAnalyzerId，在 fieldSchema 中声明字段的 type、method（extract/generate/classify）与 description，classify 字段用 enum 限定取值，文档的图表示例正是 Title 加 ChartType enum [bar, line, pie]。prebuilt-imageSearch 只生成一段文字描述，prebuilt-layout 面向文档版面且不含生成式字段，Image Analysis tags 只返回固定词表的标签。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/tutorial/create-custom-analyzer","sk":["C2.5","C2.7"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/tutorial/create-custom-analyzer","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/concepts/prebuilt-analyzers","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-understanding/image/overview"],"answer":"C"},"9103019":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1019,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Computer vision solutions","why":"Analyze Image 的四个 harm categories 无法表达品牌专属的禁用符号；custom categories (rapid) 允许用少量示例定义一个 incident（支持文本和图像），添加样本、部署后即可用 image:detectIncidents 在新图像中检测匹配内容，文档定位就是数小时内应对新出现的内容模式。Blocklist 只匹配文本，Prompt Shields 检测提示注入，调低 Hate 阈值只会增加误报而不能识别特定符号。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/how-to/custom-categories-rapid","sk":["C3.3","C3.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/how-to/custom-categories-rapid","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/content-safety/overview"],"answer":"B"},"9103020":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1020,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"v3 Translate 通过重复 to 参数（to=de&to=it）一次翻译到多种语言，textType=html 让服务保留标记，category 填入 Custom Translator 项目的 Category ID 才会使用自定义系统。逗号分隔的 to 不是合法写法，textType=plain 加 category=general 既不保留 HTML 也不使用自定义模型，allowFallback=false 只是在给定 category 时禁止回退，没有 category 则没有自定义系统可用。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/translator/text-translation/reference/v3/translate","sk":["D1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/translator/text-translation/reference/v3/translate"],"answer":"B"},"9103021":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1021,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"Fine-tuning 概览指出 SFT 适用于\"能直接演示期望行为\"的场景（prompt 与期望响应配对），能让输出遵循一致的格式、语气与 schema 并减少 prompt 中的示例以降低 token 成本；训练数据是每行一条 messages 对话的 JSONL。RFT 需要可打分的 grader 且 GPT-4.1 只支持 SFT/DPO，DPO 需要同一输入的 preferred 与 rejected 两种回答，提高 temperature 只会让输出更随机。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","sk":["D1.4","D1.1"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/fine-tuning/overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/how-to/fine-tuning"],"answer":"A"},"9103022":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1022,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Text analysis solutions","why":"文档明确指出基于 voice_name 与 synthesizing 事件的合成只支持单一目标语言，不能添加多个 target language；多目标时应遍历 result.translations（按语言代码索引的字典），为每种语言创建 SpeechSynthesizer 并设置 speech_synthesis_voice_name 做手动合成。speech_recognition_language 是源语言而不是目标语言；拆成识别、Translator、合成三步虽可行但开发量更大。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/speech-service/how-to-translate-speech","sk":["D2.4"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/speech-service/how-to-translate-speech","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/speech-service/get-started-speech-translation"],"answer":"B"},"9103023":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1023,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Information extraction solutions","why":"多模态管道先用 Azure Content Understanding skill（或 Document Extraction skill）从 PDF 中提取页面文本与内嵌图像；要支持以图搜图（image-to-vector 查询），文档明确要求使用 AML skill 或 Azure Vision multimodal embeddings skill 并在索引中配置对应的 vectorizer，因为只有多模态 embedding 模型提供把图像转为向量的 vectorizer。GenAI Prompt skill 的图像文字化只支持文本到向量查询，AzureOpenAIEmbedding 只嵌入文本，Entity Recognition 与图像检索无关。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/multimodal-search-overview","sk":["E1.1","E1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/multimodal-search-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/vector-search-integrated-vectorization"],"answer":"AC"},"9103024":{"exam":"AI-103","n":1024,"verdict":"authored","confidence":"high","kp":"Information extraction solutions","why":"searchIndex 类型的 knowledge source 包装一个已存在的索引，所以先建索引；文档要求 knowledge source 必须先于 knowledge base 存在，因为 knowledge base 的 knowledgeSources 按名称引用 knowledge source（不能直接写索引名）；创建后每个 knowledge base 都暴露 MCP 端点，MCP 兼容的 agent 以 MCP tool 调用 knowledge_base_retrieve。Azure AI Search tool 只能指向一个索引，不能指向 knowledge base。","ref":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/agentic-knowledge-source-overview","sk":["E1.5","A1.3"],"refs":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/agentic-knowledge-source-overview","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/agentic-retrieval-how-to-create-knowledge-base","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/agentic-retrieval-how-to-retrieve"],"boxes":["Create a search index that meets the requirements for agentic retrieval.","Create a knowledge source of kind searchIndex that wraps the index.","Create a knowledge base that references the knowledge source by name.","Add the MCP endpoint of the knowledge base to the agent as an MCP tool."]}}};
